<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:03.000" end="00:00:06.500" style="s2">On my wedding day,</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.600" end="00:00:09.500" style="s2">my fiancée announced that someone else</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.500" end="00:00:09.500" style="s2">was his fated mate.</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.500" end="00:00:15.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You look beautiful today, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.800" end="00:00:17.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whoever you marry, you&#39;ll always be the</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.600" end="00:00:20.600" style="s2">apple of my eye.</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.200" end="00:00:20.600" style="s2">All that matters is that you&#39;re happy.</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.100" end="00:00:24.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once you&#39;re married, the Sinclair family</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.900" end="00:00:26.800" style="s2">will grant the Wolf Clan access to</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.500" end="00:00:28.400" style="s2">Moonlight Forest as promised. We&#39;ll also</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.800" end="00:00:30.100" style="s2">partner with the clan to distribute our</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.400" end="00:00:31.800" style="s2">feral suppressors as a show of good</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.100" end="00:00:33.800" style="s2">faith in this alliance.</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.800" end="00:00:35.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Without a witch&#39;s suppressors,</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.800" end="00:00:38.100" style="s2">a werewolf who goes feral is nothing but</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.600" end="00:00:40.200" style="s2">a raging beast.</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.100" end="00:00:42.800" style="s2">For years, I&#39;ve used my blood essence to</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.200" end="00:00:44.900" style="s2">brew Darius&#39;s moon elixir every day,</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.800" end="00:00:46.500" style="s2">keeping his feral episodes at bay and</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.900" end="00:00:47.400" style="s2">helping him become the clan&#39;s next</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.500" end="00:00:49.300" style="s2">alpha.</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.400" end="00:00:51.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria, you used up all your blood</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.300" end="00:00:53.800" style="s2">essence to save Darius when he was badly</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.000" end="00:00:55.100" style="s2">wounded and it damaged your core.</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.800" end="00:00:57.300" style="s2">Are you sure you still want to marry</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.100" end="00:00:57.300" style="s2">him?</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.000" end="00:01:02.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I believe Darius will never let me down.</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.400" end="00:01:06.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s time, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.900" end="00:01:06.000" style="s2">Let me walk you down the aisle.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.300" end="00:01:14.900" style="s2">Everyone, don&#39;t question why Aria is</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.000" end="00:01:14.900" style="s2">here. She&#39;s my fated mate.</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.300" end="00:01:27.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria, you&#39;re finally here. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.100" end="00:01:30.300" style="s2">hurry. [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.800" end="00:01:32.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, do you even know what day it is?</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.300" end="00:01:32.600" style="s2">How could you humiliate Lumeria like</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.100" end="00:01:34.200" style="s2">this?</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.600" end="00:01:36.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if she&#39;s your fated mate, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.200" end="00:01:37.900" style="s2">still my daughter&#39;s groom. How could you</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.100" end="00:01:40.800" style="s2">bring an outsider to her wedding?</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.900" end="00:01:42.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry, Mr. Sinclair, Mrs. Sinclair.</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.800" end="00:01:44.000" style="s2">This is all my fault.</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.000" end="00:01:46.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t blame her. I insisted on bringing</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.000" end="00:01:46.200" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.500" end="00:01:53.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria, Aria is only human and she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.700" end="00:01:54.600" style="s2">fragile.</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.400" end="00:01:56.900" style="s2">She can&#39;t bear to be away from me, her</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.600" end="00:01:58.400" style="s2">fated mate. Someone questioned why she</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.900" end="00:02:00.592" style="s2">was here, so I had no choice but to</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.400" end="00:02:02.486" style="s2">announce to everyone that my fated mate.</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.592" end="00:02:03.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never meant to ruin the wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.486" end="00:02:05.892" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.892" end="00:02:07.392" style="s2">I was just scared to be alone.</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.892" end="00:02:08.392" style="s2">I only wanted to see Darius from a</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.392" end="00:02:09.892" style="s2">distance.</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.392" end="00:02:11.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just be a little more understanding as</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.892" end="00:02:13.292" style="s2">you always have.</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.292" end="00:02:16.392" style="s2">Be a little kinder to Aria.</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.292" end="00:02:16.392" style="s2">She means no harm.</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.192" end="00:02:21.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, I should go. I&#39;m just upsetting</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.492" end="00:02:23.392" style="s2">everyone by staying.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.992" end="00:02:25.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where do you think you&#39;re going? I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.392" end="00:02:29.396" style="s2">your fated mate. Protecting you is my</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.892" end="00:02:29.396" style="s2">duty now and always. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.306" end="00:02:34.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.492" end="00:02:37.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be scared, Darius. I&#39;ll stay with</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.192" end="00:02:40.092" style="s2">you. Then let&#39;s never be apart, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.492" end="00:02:40.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.792" end="00:02:45.692" style="s2">I&#39;m fine. [music] As long as I&#39;m with</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.692" end="00:02:45.692" style="s2">you, I won&#39;t be afraid.</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.792" end="00:02:51.992" style="s2">Darius,</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.192" end="00:02:53.592" style="s2">today is your wedding day.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.992" end="00:02:56.092" style="s2">Don&#39;t let me ruin the most important day</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.592" end="00:02:57.992" style="s2">of your lives.</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.092" end="00:03:00.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As the future Luna, Lumeria will treat</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.992" end="00:03:00.992" style="s2">you just as well as I do.</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.092" end="00:03:11.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you wearing the moon crown the</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.292" end="00:03:13.492" style="s2">wolf clan gave me?</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.792" end="00:03:15.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, the moon crown is a sacred relic</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.492" end="00:03:17.892" style="s2">reserved for Lunas alone. Why is she</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.292" end="00:03:17.892" style="s2">wearing it?</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.792" end="00:03:23.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, it&#39;s all my fault. I just wanted</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.092" end="00:03:24.592" style="s2">to see the legendary moon crown.</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.092" end="00:03:27.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could you see the moon crown when</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.592" end="00:03:29.892" style="s2">it&#39;s on your own head?</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.592" end="00:03:31.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not speak of her like that, Lumeria.</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.892" end="00:03:33.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Sinclair has had everything handed</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.392" end="00:03:36.092" style="s2">to her since she was little. She must be</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.292" end="00:03:38.192" style="s2">so happy, unlike me. I only have you,</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.092" end="00:03:39.492" style="s2">Darius.</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.192" end="00:03:41.792" style="s2">You know better than I do what this</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.492" end="00:03:44.492" style="s2">crown represents. Don&#39;t make a mockery</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.792" end="00:03:46.292" style="s2">of the Luna&#39;s dignity.</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.492" end="00:03:48.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Sinclair, please don&#39;t be angry</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.292" end="00:03:50.592" style="s2">with Darius. If this is going to cause a</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.492" end="00:03:52.192" style="s2">fight between you two,</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.592" end="00:03:54.192" style="s2">I&#39;ll take it off and give it back right</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.192" end="00:03:55.692" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.192" end="00:03:57.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why take it off?</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.692" end="00:03:59.592" style="s2">I told you to wear it. Just leave it on.</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.992" end="00:04:01.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;d rather let her cross every line</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.592" end="00:04:02.794" style="s2">just to keep protecting her?</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.092" end="00:04:05.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria, Aria is my fated mate,</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.794" end="00:04:06.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; but because of you she&#39;ll never be Luna.</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.094" end="00:04:07.894" style="s2">Can&#39;t you be a little more understanding</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.694" end="00:04:08.994" style="s2">and let her wear the moon crown just</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.894" end="00:04:11.394" style="s2">once?</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.994" end="00:04:14.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understanding? You&#39;d sacrifice my</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.394" end="00:04:17.294" style="s2">dignity just to give her what she wants?</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.094" end="00:04:17.294" style="s2">what am I even to you?</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.994" end="00:04:21.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumaria, this is Arya.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.894" end="00:04:24.194" style="s2">She is</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.294" end="00:04:24.194" style="s2">my fated mate.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.694" end="00:04:27.994" style="s2">But believe me, it&#39;s just a curse we</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.294" end="00:04:29.794" style="s2">can&#39;t resist. You&#39;re still the one I</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.994" end="00:04:31.094" style="s2">truly love. What we have will never</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.794" end="00:04:33.394" style="s2">change.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.094" end="00:04:34.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, have you forgotten the vows you</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.394" end="00:04:36.294" style="s2">made to me?</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.594" end="00:04:37.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You just want to marry me, don&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.294" end="00:04:38.694" style="s2">I&#39;m still going to marry you, so what</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.494" end="00:04:41.194" style="s2">difference does it make who wears the</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.694" end="00:04:41.194" style="s2">moon crown?</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.594" end="00:04:52.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What we have will never change.</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.294" end="00:04:56.094" style="s2">Lumaria, you don&#39;t have to put up with</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.694" end="00:04:57.694" style="s2">this. If you don&#39;t want to go through</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.094" end="00:04:59.194" style="s2">with this, we&#39;ll leave right now.</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.694" end="00:05:00.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My daughter, don&#39;t worry about the</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.194" end="00:05:02.294" style="s2">consequences. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.494" end="00:05:03.194" style="s2">Mom and dad will always support whatever</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.294" end="00:05:05.394" style="s2">you decide.</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.194" end="00:05:07.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, mom, I&#39;m fine. I&#39;ll handle this</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.394" end="00:05:09.694" style="s2">myself. You two go ahead and take your</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.294" end="00:05:09.694" style="s2">seats.</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.694" end="00:05:13.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today is the most important day of my</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.994" end="00:05:16.094" style="s2">life because I&#39;m finally marrying the</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.394" end="00:05:16.094" style="s2">one I love.</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.994" end="00:05:21.094" style="s2">And on this special day, I want to</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.494" end="00:05:22.594" style="s2">introduce the miracle the moon goddess</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.094" end="00:05:25.894" style="s2">has blessed me with, the other half of</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.594" end="00:05:25.894" style="s2">my soul, Arya.</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.094" end="00:05:30.694" style="s2">She may be an ordinary human,</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.194" end="00:05:32.794" style="s2">but she has a strong, kind soul.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.694" end="00:05:34.994" style="s2">With [snorts] her, I found true peace.</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.794" end="00:05:35.894" style="s2">Without Arya, I wouldn&#39;t be who I am</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.994" end="00:05:37.594" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.894" end="00:05:38.994" style="s2">So I hope everyone here will accept her</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.594" end="00:05:42.594" style="s2">as they would a Luna and give her the</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.994" end="00:05:42.594" style="s2">respect she deserves.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.794" end="00:05:49.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luminia,</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.294" end="00:05:52.394" style="s2">I know you&#39;re angry with me, but I just</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.994" end="00:05:55.094" style="s2">love Darius too much. I swear I never</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.394" end="00:05:57.294" style="s2">meant to ruin your wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.094" end="00:05:58.994" style="s2">It&#39;s all my fault. I &#39;m sorry my being</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.294" end="00:06:00.894" style="s2">his fated mate has caused you so much</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.994" end="00:06:02.894" style="s2">pain. Please accept this wine as my</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.894" end="00:06:04.795" style="s2">apology. I won&#39;t compete with you for</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.894" end="00:06:07.395" style="s2">anything. I just ask that you don&#39;t send</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.795" end="00:06:07.395" style="s2">me away.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.495" end="00:06:15.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As long as you&#39;re okay, that&#39;s all that</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.395" end="00:06:16.895" style="s2">matters. It&#39;s just a wedding truce.</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.495" end="00:06:18.495" style="s2">Lumiria won&#39;t mind.</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.895" end="00:06:21.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watching them act so concerned for each</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.495" end="00:06:23.495" style="s2">other makes me look like the villain.</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.895" end="00:06:25.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumiria, wipe that look off your face.</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.495" end="00:06:26.695" style="s2">Can&#39;t you see you&#39;ve scared Aria? Your</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.195" end="00:06:28.395" style="s2">dress is stained, so go back dazed and</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.695" end="00:06:29.795" style="s2">change. Don&#39;t make a spectacle of</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.395" end="00:06:30.895" style="s2">yourself in front of everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.795" end="00:06:32.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A spectacle?</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.895" end="00:06:34.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. Since you need to change,</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.495" end="00:06:36.334" style="s2">Aria can give the speech for you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.314" end="00:06:36.334" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.695" end="00:06:41.595" style="s2">Lumiria, you finally come around.</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.195" end="00:06:44.795" style="s2">I knew you&#39;d show the grace of a future</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.595" end="00:06:46.295" style="s2">Luna and welcome her into our family.</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.795" end="00:06:48.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take my place</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.295" end="00:06:48.695" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.095" end="00:07:01.795" style="s2">Hold on, Darius. I&#39;m not going to let</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.195" end="00:07:01.795" style="s2">you die.</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.395" end="00:07:09.495" style="s2">Miss Sinclair, please don&#39;t be angry</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.195" end="00:07:11.095" style="s2">with Darius. Even if I&#39;m not as strong</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.495" end="00:07:13.195" style="s2">as you, I&#39;ll do everything I can to</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.095" end="00:07:16.395" style="s2">protect him. He&#39;s just too devoted to</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.195" end="00:07:16.395" style="s2">the people he cares about.</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.395" end="00:07:22.495" style="s2">Lumiria,</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.895" end="00:07:24.095" style="s2">so what if you&#39;re so high and mighty?</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.495" end="00:07:26.595" style="s2">Everything you have will be mine in the</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.095" end="00:07:26.595" style="s2">end.</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.195" end="00:07:33.195" style="s2">Damn it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.495" end="00:07:33.195" style="s2">Did I lose them?</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.895" end="00:07:41.195" style="s2">Just my luck. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.395" end="00:07:42.495" style="s2">Darius, the Wolf Clan&#39;s future Alpha.</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.195" end="00:07:45.595" style="s2">The future Alpha still doesn&#39;t have a</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.495" end="00:07:47.695" style="s2">fated mate, even though he&#39;s engaged. If</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.595" end="00:07:48.795" style="s2">I save him, my days on the run will be</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.695" end="00:07:52.595" style="s2">over,</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.795" end="00:07:52.595" style="s2">and I&#39;ll finally live in luxury.</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.895" end="00:08:01.795" style="s2">Darius, dream on. I&#39;ll never perform the</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.695" end="00:08:01.795" style="s2">soul blessing on her.</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.695" end="00:08:06.895" style="s2">Darius,</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.995" end="00:08:08.697" style="s2">don&#39;t pressure Miss Sinclair like this.</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.895" end="00:08:09.697" style="s2">I&#39;m fine. I don&#39;t need the soul</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.697" end="00:08:11.997" style="s2">blessing.</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.697" end="00:08:15.297" style="s2">As long as I can stay by your side,</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.997" end="00:08:15.297" style="s2">I don&#39;t mind suffering a little.</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.897" end="00:08:19.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria, you&#39;ve already accepted Eros,</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.897" end="00:08:21.797" style="s2">so why are you making such a big deal</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.197" end="00:08:21.797" style="s2">out of this now?</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.197" end="00:08:26.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria, let&#39;s never be a part.</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.397" end="00:08:33.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria, since Aria is my fated mate,</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.697" end="00:08:35.097" style="s2">you should take better care of her too.</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.497" end="00:08:37.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius,</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.097" end="00:08:40.097" style="s2">give me the potion. Without it, my core</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.897" end="00:08:42.397" style="s2">will shatter.</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.097" end="00:08:45.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aria accidentally scraped her hand. This</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.397" end="00:08:45.297" style="s2">potion will heal it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.897" end="00:08:49.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the life-saving potion my parents</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.797" end="00:08:51.197" style="s2">prepared for me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.497" end="00:08:52.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have plenty of magic.</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.197" end="00:08:54.497" style="s2">You won&#39;t die.</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.497" end="00:08:55.897" style="s2">Aria is only human.</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.497" end="00:08:58.697" style="s2">How could she be expected to endure a</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.897" end="00:08:58.697" style="s2">wound like that?</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.097" end="00:09:08.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, get one thing straight. Whose</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.097" end="00:09:08.897" style="s2">wedding is this?</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.897" end="00:09:13.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone knows Lumeria has always chased</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.397" end="00:09:14.397" style="s2">after Darius. I bet she&#39;ll cave and give</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.497" end="00:09:16.197" style="s2">in to him again.</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.397" end="00:09:17.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But Darius is going too far. Without a</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.197" end="00:09:19.297" style="s2">mate mark, who&#39;s going to recognize</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.697" end="00:09:20.897" style="s2">Lumeria as the Wolf Clan&#39;s Vina?</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.297" end="00:09:22.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s her own fault. Who else would</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.897" end="00:09:23.597" style="s2">want a witch with a damaged core besides</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.697" end="00:09:25.797" style="s2">Darius?</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.597" end="00:09:28.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t marry him.</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.797" end="00:09:30.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria, have you lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.097" end="00:09:32.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said I won&#39;t accept a marriage this</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.697" end="00:09:33.497" style="s2">humiliating.</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.097" end="00:09:35.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Sinclair,</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.497" end="00:09:37.597" style="s2">don&#39;t do anything rash. This could ruin</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.497" end="00:09:38.597" style="s2">your reputation.</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.597" end="00:09:40.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.597" end="00:09:42.097" style="s2">Keep up the act. The whole world knows</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.797" end="00:09:43.697" style="s2">you are marrying into the Wolf Clan</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.097" end="00:09:44.697" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.697" end="00:09:46.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.697" end="00:09:48.797" style="s2">Where else could she go if she left the</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.097" end="00:09:50.797" style="s2">Wolf Clan?</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.797" end="00:09:53.597" style="s2">Then watch closely.</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.797" end="00:09:53.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.697" end="00:09:59.997" style="s2">What kind OF POWER IS THIS?</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.897" end="00:10:10.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THAT IS</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.197" end="00:10:10.998" style="s2">THE LEGENDARY ELF KING.</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.497" end="00:10:12.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They say he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.998" end="00:10:15.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; practically a god, and he hasn&#39; shown</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.998" end="00:10:17.898" style="s2">himself in ages. What could bring him</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.098" end="00:10:17.898" style="s2">here in person?</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.698" end="00:10:26.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Calith,</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.298" end="00:10:27.898" style="s2">will you marry me?</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.098" end="00:10:31.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumaria, what makes you think the elf</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.898" end="00:10:31.098" style="s2">king would play along with you?</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.698" end="00:10:41.398" style="s2">The honor is mine, Lumaria. From this</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.898" end="00:10:42.562" style="s2">day on, you&#39;ll be the one and only elf</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.398" end="00:10:43.498" style="s2">queen.</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.562" end="00:10:45.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.498" end="00:10:47.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The elf king actually said yes?</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.898" end="00:10:49.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a joke. Who does Lumaria think she</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.798" end="00:10:51.098" style="s2">is? Why would the legendary elf king</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.798" end="00:10:52.098" style="s2">play along with her?</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.098" end="00:10:53.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.098" end="00:10:55.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, this witch must have</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.898" end="00:10:58.198" style="s2">deceived you. Someone like her.</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.998" end="00:10:59.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silence.</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.198" end="00:11:01.098" style="s2">I</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.498" end="00:11:02.698" style="s2">I&#39;m the wolf clan&#39;s future alpha, and</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.098" end="00:11:04.298" style="s2">Lumaria is destined to be its future</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.698" end="00:11:05.598" style="s2">Luna. You&#39;re trampling on the ancient</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.298" end="00:11:07.598" style="s2">pact between the wolf clan and the</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.598" end="00:11:09.798" style="s2">witches.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.598" end="00:11:12.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, you won&#39;t be the future alpha</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.798" end="00:11:12.698" style="s2">for much longer.</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.098" end="00:11:16.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumaria, stop this nonsense. You think</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.198" end="00:11:19.098" style="s2">you can threaten my position as the</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.398" end="00:11:19.098" style="s2">future alpha?</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.598" end="00:11:24.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I, Lumaria Sinclair, hereby declare in</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.698" end="00:11:26.598" style="s2">the name of the Sinclair family that</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.498" end="00:11:28.098" style="s2">effective immediately, I revoke all</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.598" end="00:11:31.098" style="s2">resources and privileges granted to</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.098" end="00:11:32.898" style="s2">Darius through his engagement to me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.098" end="00:11:34.398" style="s2">Without the Sinclair family&#39;s support,</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.898" end="00:11:35.898" style="s2">let&#39;s see if the wolf clan&#39;s council of</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.398" end="00:11:37.098" style="s2">elders still recognizes you as the</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.898" end="00:11:38.598" style="s2">future alpha.</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.098" end="00:11:40.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.598" end="00:11:42.098" style="s2">Lumaria, you&#39;re just mad I dumped you in</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.298" end="00:11:43.698" style="s2">front of everyone and want to save face.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.098" end="00:11:45.698" style="s2">I bet you&#39;ll come crawling back and beg</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.698" end="00:11:47.898" style="s2">me to forgive you before the day&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.698" end="00:11:51.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever Lumaria decides, the Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.898" end="00:11:51.098" style="s2">family stands with her.</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.298" end="00:11:58.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Sinclair,</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.098" end="00:11:58.298" style="s2">this is all my fault.</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.298" end="00:12:05.998" style="s2">Just punish me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.698" end="00:12:09.598" style="s2">Please don&#39;t drag Darius into this.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.998" end="00:12:09.598" style="s2">He&#39;s the one you love most, isn&#39;t he?</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.198" end="00:12:13.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you waiting for? Clear the</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.599" end="00:12:15.599" style="s2">hall.</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.399" end="00:12:15.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.499" end="00:12:20.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET ME GO.</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.399" end="00:12:22.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LUMIRIA, YOU&#39;LL REGRET THIS. THERE&#39;S NO</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.599" end="00:12:24.699" style="s2">WAY THE ELF KING WILL ACTUALLY marry</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.799" end="00:12:27.899" style="s2">you. I&#39;ll be waiting for you TO COME</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.699" end="00:12:29.899" style="s2">CRAWLING BACK AND BEG ME.</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.899" end="00:12:33.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHY HER? How does she get to land the</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.899" end="00:12:33.699" style="s2">mighty Elf King so easily?</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.199" end="00:12:40.399" style="s2">Darius? Why do you look like that?</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.899" end="00:12:45.299" style="s2">What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.399" end="00:12:46.499" style="s2">The wedding&#39;s already started. Why are</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.299" end="00:12:49.099" style="s2">you all out here?</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.499" end="00:12:50.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, why are you just getting here?</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.099" end="00:12:52.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumiria should consider herself lucky to</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.899" end="00:12:55.299" style="s2">marry into our clan. She&#39;s lucky I even</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.699" end="00:12:55.299" style="s2">showed up.</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.399" end="00:12:58.699" style="s2">But what&#39;s going on here? Who dared</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.199" end="00:13:01.099" style="s2">throw out the future Alpha?</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.699" end="00:13:02.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rowena, I&#39;m sorry. Darius refused to</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.099" end="00:13:04.399" style="s2">give Ms. Sinclair the mate mark at the</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.499" end="00:13:05.599" style="s2">wedding because of me. So she got angry</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.399" end="00:13:07.399" style="s2">and kicked us all out.</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.599" end="00:13:08.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Over something so trivial, Lumerta</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.399" end="00:13:10.699" style="s2">actually dares to break off the</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.699" end="00:13:13.299" style="s2">engagement and throw you all out?</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.699" end="00:13:15.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She simply has too much of a temper.</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.299" end="00:13:17.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare she humiliate us like this?</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.499" end="00:13:19.799" style="s2">Darius is the future Alpha. Once she</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.899" end="00:13:21.299" style="s2">marries into our clan,</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.799" end="00:13:23.499" style="s2">I&#39;ll teach her her place.</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.299" end="00:13:25.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rowena, please do not be angry. It is</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.499" end="00:13:26.799" style="s2">all my fault. Perhaps I should never</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.299" end="00:13:30.399" style="s2">have come to the wedding, but I only</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.799" end="00:13:30.399" style="s2">wanted to wish Darius well and</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.499" end="00:13:34.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There, there. How could this be your</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.799" end="00:13:35.999" style="s2">fault? An Alpha is meant to be with the</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.099" end="00:13:37.599" style="s2">mate who&#39;s right for him. Lumiria just</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.999" end="00:13:40.099" style="s2">couldn&#39;t keep an Alpha&#39;s heart, so she</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.599" end="00:13:42.499" style="s2">got what she deserved.</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.099" end="00:13:44.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumiria is merely throwing a tantrum.</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.499" end="00:13:46.099" style="s2">She loves me so much.</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.399" end="00:13:48.299" style="s2">How could she truly bear to leave me?</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.099" end="00:13:51.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But didn&#39;t you say the Elf King accepted</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.299" end="00:13:51.899" style="s2">her proposal in front of everyone?</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.514" end="00:13:55.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.499" end="00:13:57.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you actually believe that? How</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.699" end="00:13:58.699" style="s2">could the mighty Elf King really marry</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.699" end="00:14:00.299" style="s2">her?</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.699" end="00:14:01.999" style="s2">He&#39;s just playing along to show respect</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.299" end="00:14:02.999" style="s2">for the Sinclair family and make me look</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.999" end="00:14:04.299" style="s2">bad.</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.999" end="00:14:06.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.299" end="00:14:08.099" style="s2">The Elf King is far too important to</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.099" end="00:14:11.099" style="s2">ever be interested in her.</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.099" end="00:14:12.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumiria is just trying to force my hand.</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.099" end="00:14:14.901" style="s2">Once she calms down, she&#39;ll realize that</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.799" end="00:14:17.501" style="s2">no one else would dare marry a woman the</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.901" end="00:14:19.701" style="s2">wolf clan has rejected.</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.501" end="00:14:21.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.701" end="00:14:25.701" style="s2">Let&#39; go home for now. We&#39;ll see how long</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.901" end="00:14:25.701" style="s2">that arrogant woman can keep this up.</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.001" end="00:14:30.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria,</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.301" end="00:14:34.101" style="s2">sooner or later you&#39;ll come crying back</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.601" end="00:14:34.101" style="s2">and beg me to forgive you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.301" end="00:14:37.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for today, Caelith. Had you</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.101" end="00:14:38.901" style="s2">not appeared in time, the Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.501" end="00:14:41.901" style="s2">family&#39;s honor would have been trampled</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.901" end="00:14:41.901" style="s2">before the wolf clan.</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.101" end="00:14:48.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You never need to thank me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.001" end="00:14:50.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just now in the wedding hall, my public</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.501" end="00:14:52.801" style="s2">proposal to you was indeed a desperate</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.901" end="00:14:54.201" style="s2">move to break the stalemate.</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.801" end="00:14:56.501" style="s2">I refused to endure Darius&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.201" end="00:14:59.801" style="s2">humiliation, so</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.501" end="00:14:59.801" style="s2">in that moment I used you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.901" end="00:15:03.801" style="s2">Caelith, I know the elves never lightly</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.201" end="00:15:06.501" style="s2">involve themselves in the disputes of</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.801" end="00:15:08.301" style="s2">other races. If you feel offended,</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.501" end="00:15:10.801" style="s2">today&#39;s proposal can be withdrawn at any</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.301" end="00:15:10.801" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.201" end="00:15:13.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I refuse.</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.201" end="00:15:17.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.001" end="00:15:20.201" style="s2">You need not force yourself for the sake</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.501" end="00:15:20.201" style="s2">of my pride.</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.901" end="00:15:27.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria, what I said at the wedding,</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.101" end="00:15:27.501" style="s2">I swear it by the elves, stands forever.</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.701" end="00:15:33.801" style="s2">The honor is mine, Lumeria. From this</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.501" end="00:15:36.201" style="s2">day on, you&#39;ll be the one and only elf</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.801" end="00:15:36.201" style="s2">queen.</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.601" end="00:15:40.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Caelith.</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.101" end="00:15:42.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today it was not you who used me, but I</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.401" end="00:15:44.301" style="s2">who used you. I have been waiting all</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.501" end="00:15:47.140" style="s2">along, waiting for the day you would</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.301" end="00:15:49.160" style="s2">turn and look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.140" end="00:15:49.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell and snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.701" end="00:15:55.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Caelith,</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.201" end="00:15:57.901" style="s2">do I deserve this from you?</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.401" end="00:16:00.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elves live long, yet only when I met you</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.901" end="00:16:04.201" style="s2">did my heart finally beat again.</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.601" end="00:16:04.201" style="s2">To me you will always be worth it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.101" end="00:16:09.401" style="s2">Lumeria,</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.401" end="00:16:09.401" style="s2">will you give me a chance?</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.101" end="00:16:16.701" style="s2">Lumeria dared to humiliate me before so</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.401" end="00:16:18.202" style="s2">many people today. When she comes to beg</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.701" end="00:16:21.002" style="s2">my forgiveness, I will make her</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.202" end="00:16:23.802" style="s2">understand the price of offending her</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.002" end="00:16:23.802" style="s2">own Alpha.</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.102" end="00:16:29.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Indeed, Darius. A woman who has lost her</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.002" end="00:16:32.002" style="s2">Alpha&#39;s protection will soon come to see</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.302" end="00:16:32.002" style="s2">reality.</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.702" end="00:16:36.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, it is all my fault.</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.202" end="00:16:38.702" style="s2">I will go and apologize to Lumera at</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.702" end="00:16:41.702" style="s2">once. Had I known it would bring you</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.702" end="00:16:45.102" style="s2">such humiliation, I would never</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.702" end="00:16:45.102" style="s2">I should never have saved you back then.</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.202" end="00:16:48.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aria, you are my fated mate. How could I</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.102" end="00:16:50.302" style="s2">blame you?</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.502" end="00:16:52.302" style="s2">It is Lumera who is making a fuss over</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.302" end="00:16:55.502" style="s2">nothing, showing none of the magnanimity</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.302" end="00:16:55.502" style="s2">a future Lunar should have.</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.002" end="00:17:00.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But since Lumera has so little regard</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.602" end="00:17:03.602" style="s2">for your honor, is there not</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.202" end="00:17:03.602" style="s2">Is there not a better choice than her?</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.802" end="00:17:08.002" style="s2">As long as that person loves you</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.102" end="00:17:09.802" style="s2">wholeheartedly and thinks only of you,</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.002" end="00:17:11.502" style="s2">even without a background as illustrious</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.802" end="00:17:14.502" style="s2">as the Saint-Claire family,</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.502" end="00:17:17.202" style="s2">could she not stay by your side forever?</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.502" end="00:17:17.202" style="s2">Is that not so?</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.302" end="00:17:22.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aria, you do not understand.</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.502" end="00:17:24.902" style="s2">The future Alpha cannot have only one</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.102" end="00:17:24.902" style="s2">woman who loves him.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.402" end="00:17:30.502" style="s2">Besides, Lumera loves me so much that</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.702" end="00:17:32.402" style="s2">she once even used up all her blood</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.502" end="00:17:33.702" style="s2">essence to save me. How could she truly</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.402" end="00:17:35.702" style="s2">leave me?</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.702" end="00:17:37.202" style="s2">Today she is merely livid and trying to</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.702" end="00:17:39.502" style="s2">use the Elf King to goad me into</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.202" end="00:17:41.502" style="s2">yielding.</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.502" end="00:17:42.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Once she has made enough fuss,</p>
<p begin="00:17:41.502" end="00:17:44.302" style="s2">she will realize the Elf King will never</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.902" end="00:17:46.502" style="s2">marry her and she will come back of her</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.302" end="00:17:48.102" style="s2">own accord to apologize to you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.502" end="00:17:49.302" style="s2">We need only wait and see how she digs</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.102" end="00:17:51.502" style="s2">health out.</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.302" end="00:17:52.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie is right.</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.502" end="00:17:54.502" style="s2">I was merely too worried about you,</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.902" end="00:17:56.002" style="s2">Darius.</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.502" end="00:17:57.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rest assured,</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.002" end="00:18:00.102" style="s2">even without the mate mark, she cannot</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.702" end="00:18:02.202" style="s2">escape my grasp.</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.102" end="00:18:05.302" style="s2">And as for Luna,</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.202" end="00:18:05.302" style="s2">it can only ever be her.</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.802" end="00:18:11.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will do whatever you say, Darius.</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.207" end="00:18:15.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.802" end="00:18:21.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.002" end="00:18:21.102" style="s2">Why does it hurt so much?</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.687" end="00:18:25.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.303" end="00:18:31.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumaria, stay away from me. I will hurt</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.303" end="00:18:31.503" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.703" end="00:18:36.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, quickly, drink it. The pain will</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.703" end="00:18:36.703" style="s2">stop once you drink.</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.803" end="00:18:45.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumaria, thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.103" end="00:18:49.803" style="s2">Without you, I truly do not know how I</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.903" end="00:18:51.903" style="s2">would endure this torment.</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.803" end="00:18:55.503" style="s2">But you</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.903" end="00:18:55.503" style="s2">Did you use your blood essence again?</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.403" end="00:19:00.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As long as it makes you well again, I</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.803" end="00:19:03.403" style="s2">would do anything.</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.503" end="00:19:07.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumaria, you are so foolish.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.403" end="00:19:07.003" style="s2">I swear I will never let you down.</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.203" end="00:19:11.103" style="s2">Just leave it there. This stuff again, I</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.103" end="00:19:13.703" style="s2">am sick of it. Can you stop pestering me</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.103" end="00:19:13.703" style="s2">all the time?</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.088" end="00:19:18.108" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.003" end="00:19:24.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, with Lumira gone, let me take</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.803" end="00:19:24.903" style="s2">care of you from now on.</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.103" end="00:19:27.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave it there for now.</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.303" end="00:19:35.793" style="s2">Get away.</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.773" end="00:19:35.793" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.203" end="00:19:44.308" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DARIUS, IT IS ME, ARIA.</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.288" end="00:19:44.308" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.703" end="00:19:52.603" style="s2">DAMN IT.</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.103" end="00:19:52.603" style="s2">I SHOULD NEVER HAVE LOCKED THE DOOR.</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.703" end="00:19:58.603" style="s2">HELP. SOMEBODY, ANYBODY, HELP.</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.503" end="00:20:03.248" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DARIUS,</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.303" end="00:20:05.268" style="s2">STOP AT ONCE.</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.248" end="00:20:05.268" style="s2">[screaming and groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.798" end="00:20:12.903" style="s2">[panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.803" end="00:20:14.603" style="s2">IT IS OVER NOW, DARIUS.</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.903" end="00:20:15.903" style="s2">DO NOT BE AFRAID. The feral rage has</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.603" end="00:20:18.203" style="s2">passed.</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.903" end="00:20:21.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.203" end="00:20:22.905" style="s2">this mask produced suppresses.</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.103" end="00:20:24.105" style="s2">It feels like it is tearing my veins</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.905" end="00:20:27.005" style="s2">apart.</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.105" end="00:20:28.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The potency is dreadful.</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.005" end="00:20:30.505" style="s2">If you truly lost control and killed</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.705" end="00:20:33.605" style="s2">someone, how would we ever answer to the</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.505" end="00:20:33.605" style="s2">council of elders?</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.205" end="00:20:41.805" style="s2">When Lumetta was still here, you never</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.905" end="00:20:41.805" style="s2">had to endure this torment.</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.205" end="00:20:47.405" style="s2">She has only been gone a day and it has</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.905" end="00:20:47.405" style="s2">reduced you to this state.</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.805" end="00:20:51.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Indeed, this suppressive cannot compare</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.905" end="00:20:53.305" style="s2">to the moon elixir she prepared</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.405" end="00:20:54.905" style="s2">especially for me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.305" end="00:20:56.605" style="s2">Without her, I cannot even sleep</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.905" end="00:20:59.305" style="s2">soundly.</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.605" end="00:21:01.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumiria again. Why even after she has</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.305" end="00:21:04.205" style="s2">gone must she still haunt me and loom</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.305" end="00:21:07.905" style="s2">over me? Just you wait. The position of</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.205" end="00:21:07.905" style="s2">Luna can only ever be mine.</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.905" end="00:21:15.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It seems the wolf clan&#39;s future leader</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.005" end="00:21:15.105" style="s2">can no longer even control himself.</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.505" end="00:21:21.005" style="s2">The mighty future alpha of the wolf</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.705" end="00:21:22.905" style="s2">clan, unable to control his feral rage,</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.005" end="00:21:24.605" style="s2">making a laughing stock of himself in</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.905" end="00:21:26.705" style="s2">his own manner.</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.605" end="00:21:30.305" style="s2">Darius,</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.705" end="00:21:30.305" style="s2">you have sorely disappointed me.</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.805" end="00:21:34.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elder,</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.205" end="00:21:36.805" style="s2">this was only an accident.</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.705" end="00:21:38.605" style="s2">I have always been stable and never once</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.805" end="00:21:40.105" style="s2">slipped up. The suppressive simply was</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.605" end="00:21:42.305" style="s2">not effective this time. It will never</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.105" end="00:21:43.705" style="s2">happen again.</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.305" end="00:21:45.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius,</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.705" end="00:21:47.405" style="s2">are you trying to deceive me or</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.105" end="00:21:50.605" style="s2">yourself? Who do you think you owe your</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.405" end="00:21:53.405" style="s2">stability these past few years to?</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.605" end="00:21:55.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elder Silas, please calm down. Darius</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.405" end="00:21:57.005" style="s2">never wanted this.</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.105" end="00:21:58.905" style="s2">It is all that ungrateful girl Lumir&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.005" end="00:22:01.905" style="s2">fault for making him suffer like this.</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.905" end="00:22:03.305" style="s2">Once her anger cools and she returns</p>
<p begin="00:22:01.905" end="00:22:05.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you think the eldest daughter of the</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.305" end="00:22:08.005" style="s2">Sinclair family is someone you can</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.105" end="00:22:09.705" style="s2">summon and dismiss at will? Have you too</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.005" end="00:22:11.405" style="s2">grown so complacent that you have</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.705" end="00:22:14.505" style="s2">forgotten where everything you now</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.405" end="00:22:14.505" style="s2">possess came from?</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.505" end="00:22:19.805" style="s2">And you,</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.705" end="00:22:21.405" style="s2">do not think I am unaware of what you</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.805" end="00:22:23.505" style="s2">did at the wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.405" end="00:22:27.105" style="s2">An ordinary human</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.505" end="00:22:27.105" style="s2">daring to dream of the seat of</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.206" end="00:22:30.606" style="s2">Darius, you had better come to your</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.406" end="00:22:32.806" style="s2">senses. The reason you hold this</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.606" end="00:22:35.106" style="s2">position of succession so securely is</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.806" end="00:22:38.306" style="s2">not your own excellence, but entirely</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.106" end="00:22:39.306" style="s2">Lumeria&#39;s sincerity towards you.</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.306" end="00:22:40.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elder, I</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.306" end="00:22:43.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Without the Sinclair family opening</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.906" end="00:22:45.106" style="s2">Moonlight Forest to us, how would you</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.006" end="00:22:46.606" style="s2">resolve the wolf clan&#39;s feral problem?</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.106" end="00:22:48.706" style="s2">What is more,</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.606" end="00:22:50.806" style="s2">without the special suppressors Lumeria</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.706" end="00:22:52.806" style="s2">prepares for you, you are nothing but a</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.806" end="00:22:54.205" style="s2">monster that could lose its mind at any</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.806" end="00:22:54.906" style="s2">moment.</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.205" end="00:22:57.206" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.906" end="00:23:00.806" style="s2">I do not care what it takes.</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.206" end="00:23:03.106" style="s2">You must win Lumeria back.</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.806" end="00:23:04.806" style="s2">Win her back. If you cannot win Lumeria</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.106" end="00:23:06.606" style="s2">back, then you can forget about this</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.806" end="00:23:08.906" style="s2">seat of succession.</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.606" end="00:23:11.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elder, you have seen it yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.906" end="00:23:13.506" style="s2">Lumeria now has the elf king behind her.</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.306" end="00:23:15.206" style="s2">Even if I go to beg her now, how could</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.506" end="00:23:17.306" style="s2">she possibly pay me any mind?</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.206" end="00:23:19.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the elf king? Do you think the elf</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.306" end="00:23:21.506" style="s2">king is someone so easily fooled?</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.706" end="00:23:23.906" style="s2">A being so lofty is merely doing the</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.506" end="00:23:25.106" style="s2">Sinclair family a courtesy.</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.906" end="00:23:27.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are right.</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.106" end="00:23:29.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The elves have always been proud. How</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.306" end="00:23:31.906" style="s2">could Caelith ever marry a woman whose</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.106" end="00:23:34.006" style="s2">engagement our wolf clan has broken off?</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.906" end="00:23:36.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If it is all merely an act, then why</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.006" end="00:23:38.406" style="s2">should our Darius go groveling for the</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.306" end="00:23:40.106" style="s2">wolf clan&#39;s future alpha to beg an</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.406" end="00:23:41.706" style="s2">ungrateful girl?</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.106" end="00:23:43.406" style="s2">Would that not make us a laughing stock</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.706" end="00:23:45.306" style="s2">before the other families?</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.406" end="00:23:47.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why after all the trouble she has caused</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.306" end="00:23:49.306" style="s2">must Darius still go and beg her? I</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.206" end="00:23:51.906" style="s2">absolutely cannot let her come back.</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.306" end="00:23:54.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ignorance. Is Darius&#39;s pride worth more</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.906" end="00:23:56.486" style="s2">than the wolf clan&#39;s survival?</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.466" end="00:23:56.486" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.006" end="00:24:01.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have had apology gifts prepared.</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.906" end="00:24:05.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, take them now, at once, and go</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.806" end="00:24:05.206" style="s2">apologize to Lumeria.</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.906" end="00:24:09.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elder, this</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.406" end="00:24:11.206" style="s2">so many.</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.906" end="00:24:12.806" style="s2">You even added the heart of the moon</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.206" end="00:24:14.606" style="s2">goddess, sealed away in the forbidden</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.806" end="00:24:15.906" style="s2">grounds all this time.</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.606" end="00:24:18.206" style="s2">Is that not something only the most</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.906" end="00:24:19.806" style="s2">noble Luna of every generation may wear?</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.206" end="00:24:21.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Had you not indulged that senseless</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.806" end="00:24:22.506" style="s2">creature in making a scene at the</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.006" end="00:24:25.306" style="s2">wedding, would the wolf clan have had to</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.506" end="00:24:25.306" style="s2">bleed so much?</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.506" end="00:24:28.807" style="s2">This time, you had better present this</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.306" end="00:24:31.107" style="s2">heart of the moon goddess necklace to</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.807" end="00:24:32.307" style="s2">Lumaria with the utmost deference.</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.107" end="00:24:33.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I [clears throat] am Darius&#39;s fated</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.307" end="00:24:35.507" style="s2">mate.</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.207" end="00:24:36.807" style="s2">All of this should be mine. Why must it</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.507" end="00:24:39.007" style="s2">be given to that wretch?</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.807" end="00:24:40.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will you go or not?</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.007" end="00:24:42.507" style="s2">If you cannot even manage this much, I</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.908" end="00:24:44.607" style="s2">shall announce to the whole clan this</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.507" end="00:24:47.207" style="s2">instant that your right of succession is</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.607" end="00:24:47.207" style="s2">revoked.</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.507" end="00:24:50.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will go.</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.797" end="00:24:53.707" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.807" end="00:24:56.007" style="s2">You</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.707" end="00:24:59.007" style="s2">How long have you been awake?</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.007" end="00:24:59.007" style="s2">Why did you not wake me?</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.307" end="00:25:07.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I woke not long ago myself.</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.408" end="00:25:09.408" style="s2">Seeing how soundly you slept, how could</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.007" end="00:25:12.207" style="s2">I bear to wake you?</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.408" end="00:25:13.707" style="s2">Did you rest well last night?</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.207" end="00:25:16.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was the most peaceful sleep I have</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.707" end="00:25:16.507" style="s2">had in years.</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.807" end="00:25:22.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumaria,</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.307" end="00:25:23.408" style="s2">since you have now put the past behind</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.007" end="00:25:24.908" style="s2">you for good,</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.408" end="00:25:26.408" style="s2">today I would like to formally invite</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.908" end="00:25:28.132" style="s2">you to my homeland,</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.408" end="00:25:29.307" style="s2">the elf territory.</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.132" end="00:25:31.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.307" end="00:25:32.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why invite me all of a sudden?</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.007" end="00:25:35.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To be honest, I have always wanted to</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.507" end="00:25:35.007" style="s2">invite you.</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.408" end="00:25:40.207" style="s2">You may not remember, but back then,</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.908" end="00:25:41.807" style="s2">had it not been for you,</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.207" end="00:25:44.307" style="s2">there would no longer be an elf king in</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.807" end="00:25:44.307" style="s2">this world.</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.057" end="00:25:53.077" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.677" end="00:25:55.697" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.607" end="00:26:02.107" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.507" end="00:26:03.908" style="s2">I shall engrave this life-saving debt</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.107" end="00:26:05.807" style="s2">upon my heart.</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.908" end="00:26:07.707" style="s2">One day I will repay you with everything</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.807" end="00:26:09.007" style="s2">I have. Back then you declined my</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.707" end="00:26:10.307" style="s2">invitation</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.007" end="00:26:11.408" style="s2">so I could only leave you that harp</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.307" end="00:26:14.408" style="s2">string.</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.408" end="00:26:16.107" style="s2">Thankfully, you eventually plucked it.</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.408" end="00:26:17.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius disgraced himself utterly at</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.107" end="00:26:19.807" style="s2">yesterday&#39;s wedding, knowing that clan</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.908" end="00:26:22.107" style="s2">of elders, they will surely force him to</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.807" end="00:26:23.707" style="s2">pester me again.</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.107" end="00:26:25.707" style="s2">Rather than stay here dealing with those</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.707" end="00:26:27.107" style="s2">repulsive people, it is better to keep</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.707" end="00:26:29.807" style="s2">away for a while.</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.107" end="00:26:32.809" style="s2">Besides, since I have chosen him,</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.807" end="00:26:34.943" style="s2">I truly ought to get to know him.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.809" end="00:26:36.963" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very well, I accept.</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.943" end="00:26:36.963" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.709" end="00:26:42.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I promise you you will love it there.</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.009" end="00:26:48.009" style="s2">Lumera, I have come to recognize my</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.609" end="00:26:49.909" style="s2">mistake from yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.009" end="00:26:53.009" style="s2">Please see me and let us talk things</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.909" end="00:26:53.009" style="s2">through properly, all right?</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.309" end="00:26:56.709" style="s2">Lumera, for the sake of all the years we</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.409" end="00:26:59.909" style="s2">have shared, please at least give me a</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.709" end="00:26:59.909" style="s2">chance to explain myself.</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.009" end="00:27:05.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My, what a grand display.</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.509" end="00:27:07.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have not heard? At yesterday&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.209" end="00:27:10.109" style="s2">wedding, this man humiliated Miss</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.609" end="00:27:11.909" style="s2">Sinclair in public for some fated mate</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.109" end="00:27:13.409" style="s2">who appeared out of nowhere. And now</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.909" end="00:27:15.409" style="s2">that she wants nothing to do with him,</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.409" end="00:27:19.209" style="s2">he comes crawling back begging to make</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.409" end="00:27:19.209" style="s2">peace. How shameless.</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.109" end="00:27:26.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you intend to hide from me forever?</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.109" end="00:27:26.809" style="s2">Stop soaring and open the gate.</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.009" end="00:27:36.309" style="s2">Magnus, Aurelia,</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.309" end="00:27:37.609" style="s2">I have come to make amends.</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.309" end="00:27:42.009" style="s2">I hope you can forgive me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.609" end="00:27:43.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please leave. Lumiria is not at home.</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.009" end="00:27:45.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where could she go?</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.009" end="00:27:46.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You seem to have forgotten.</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.209" end="00:27:48.609" style="s2">Yesterday was my daughter&#39;s wedding to</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.809" end="00:27:51.009" style="s2">the Elf King, so naturally they spent</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.609" end="00:27:52.609" style="s2">the night at Moonlight Manion.</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.009" end="00:27:53.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.609" end="00:27:55.309" style="s2">She</p>
<p begin="00:27:53.709" end="00:27:57.609" style="s2">she spent the whole night with that Elf</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.309" end="00:27:57.609" style="s2">King?</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.909" end="00:28:02.209" style="s2">Has the Elf King truly taken a fancy to</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.009" end="00:28:04.609" style="s2">a woman whose engagement I broke off?</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.209" end="00:28:06.709" style="s2">How could that be?</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.609" end="00:28:08.409" style="s2">I do not believe it. Lumiria must be</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.709" end="00:28:10.509" style="s2">hiding inside, sending you out to get</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.409" end="00:28:12.909" style="s2">rid of me. She loves me so much. How</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.509" end="00:28:12.909" style="s2">could she</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.109" end="00:28:16.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let him in.</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.509" end="00:28:19.309" style="s2">It is the perfect chance to make him</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.309" end="00:28:19.309" style="s2">give up for good.</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.109" end="00:28:26.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does Lumetta know the Council of Elders</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.709" end="00:28:28.209" style="s2">pressured me into apologizing and so she</p>
<p begin="00:28:26.609" end="00:28:29.309" style="s2">is deliberately refusing to show herself</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.209" end="00:28:31.509" style="s2">just to humiliate me?</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.309" end="00:28:33.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you seen enough now?</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.509" end="00:28:35.510" style="s2">Take your things and get out at once.</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.710" end="00:28:38.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have come today to apologize</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.510" end="00:28:40.310" style="s2">sincerely. When she returns, please tell</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.510" end="00:28:42.010" style="s2">her that I will not give up until I have</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.310" end="00:28:43.810" style="s2">won her forgiveness.</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.010" end="00:28:47.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me tell you right now,</p>
<p begin="00:28:43.810" end="00:28:47.110" style="s2">you are not welcome here.</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.110" end="00:28:54.410" style="s2">You were right all along.</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.910" end="00:28:54.410" style="s2">This place truly is beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.610" end="00:29:00.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So are you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.910" end="00:29:05.910" style="s2">The reason I invited you this time is</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.410" end="00:29:09.410" style="s2">chiefly to take you to the most sacred</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.910" end="00:29:09.410" style="s2">sanctuary of our elven kind.</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.180" end="00:29:12.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.910" end="00:29:17.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Such pure, pristine life force.</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.410" end="00:29:24.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Taste it. This is the spring of life&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.510" end="00:29:24.310" style="s2">welcome to you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.555" end="00:29:28.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.210" end="00:29:31.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a wondrous sensation. What a</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.910" end="00:29:33.710" style="s2">familiar power. As if I too were an elf,</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.610" end="00:29:36.710" style="s2">a member of this land.</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.710" end="00:29:38.210" style="s2">Wait, this soul piercing binding force.</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.710" end="00:29:39.710" style="s2">This is not mere spring water. It</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.210" end="00:29:41.310" style="s2">clearly carries the elf king&#39;s blood</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.710" end="00:29:42.510" style="s2">essence.</p>
<p begin="00:29:41.310" end="00:29:44.810" style="s2">Caelith,</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.510" end="00:29:44.810" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.610" end="00:29:48.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With the spring of life as my offering</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.910" end="00:29:50.110" style="s2">and the tree of life as my witness, I,</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.310" end="00:29:51.710" style="s2">Caelith, hereby vow to share my life and</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.110" end="00:29:53.810" style="s2">soul with Lumeria.</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.710" end="00:29:55.410" style="s2">My years shall be your years,</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.810" end="00:29:57.610" style="s2">and my soul shall forever be open to</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.410" end="00:29:57.610" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.510" end="00:30:00.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.410" end="00:30:07.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will not bind you with so-called fate</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.210" end="00:30:09.110" style="s2">the way the wolf clan does.</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.410" end="00:30:12.010" style="s2">What I give you is an elf&#39;s devotion and</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.110" end="00:30:13.910" style="s2">my unreserved self. Lumeria, will you</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.010" end="00:30:16.510" style="s2">become my queen and share this boundless</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.910" end="00:30:16.510" style="s2">life with me?</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.010" end="00:30:21.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius refused me the mate mark in order</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.210" end="00:30:23.510" style="s2">to humiliate me. Yet Caelith is willing</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.510" end="00:30:25.310" style="s2">to open his soul to me,</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.510" end="00:30:27.410" style="s2">offering me his life and soul without</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.310" end="00:30:29.910" style="s2">reserve.</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.410" end="00:30:31.310" style="s2">Caelith,</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.910" end="00:30:32.710" style="s2">although I said we would have a chance</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.310" end="00:30:34.510" style="s2">together,</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.710" end="00:30:36.312" style="s2">I do not think I can yet give myself as</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.510" end="00:30:38.312" style="s2">unreservedly as you do.</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.312" end="00:30:39.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumaria,</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.312" end="00:30:41.512" style="s2">you need not force yourself to give me</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.812" end="00:30:44.912" style="s2">an answer at once.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.512" end="00:30:44.912" style="s2">I give you my heart because I wish to.</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.312" end="00:30:50.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Caelus, I only saved you once.</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.312" end="00:30:52.612" style="s2">Why would you go to such lengths for me?</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.512" end="00:30:55.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was your soul that drew me in.</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.612" end="00:30:57.212" style="s2">You are resilient, kind, one of a kind.</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.712" end="00:30:58.612" style="s2">My heart has long since surrendered to</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.212" end="00:31:00.012" style="s2">you and whatever you choose it belongs</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.612" end="00:31:01.712" style="s2">to you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.012" end="00:31:03.712" style="s2">But believe me, it&#39;s just a curse we</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.712" end="00:31:06.512" style="s2">can&#39;t resist.</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.712" end="00:31:08.712" style="s2">You&#39;re still the one I truly love.</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.512" end="00:31:11.312" style="s2">What we have will never change.</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.712" end="00:31:12.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone once promised me forever too.</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.312" end="00:31:15.212" style="s2">Can I bring myself to believe in a</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.612" end="00:31:15.212" style="s2">promise again?</p>
<p begin="00:31:16.012" end="00:31:19.312" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.412" end="00:31:21.412" style="s2">The Elf King&#39;s vow is too weighty for me</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.312" end="00:31:22.712" style="s2">to accept so lightly. I still need to</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.412" end="00:31:24.612" style="s2">put you to the test.</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.712" end="00:31:26.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is my honor.</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.612" end="00:31:28.112" style="s2">The elves have nothing if not time.</p>
<p begin="00:31:26.712" end="00:31:31.812" style="s2">Even if you need a hundred years or a</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.112" end="00:31:31.812" style="s2">thousand, I shall gladly accept it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:33.312" end="00:31:36.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The trial period is forever.</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.512" end="00:31:43.812" style="s2">Have you not considered that if I</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.812" end="00:31:46.412" style="s2">refused you, I could simply enjoy the</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.812" end="00:31:48.312" style="s2">life you share with me for nothing?</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.412" end="00:31:49.512" style="s2">What would you do then?</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.312" end="00:31:52.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For you,</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.512" end="00:31:52.112" style="s2">I am willing.</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.112" end="00:31:58.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumaria, you must return at once.</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.012" end="00:32:03.312" style="s2">What has happened at home?</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.912" end="00:32:04.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Wolf Clan has been sending people</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.312" end="00:32:07.312" style="s2">over every day lately, especially</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.812" end="00:32:07.312" style="s2">Darius.</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.212" end="00:32:13.112" style="s2">He comes every day to beg forgiveness</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.612" end="00:32:14.812" style="s2">with an attitude of utmost sincerity.</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.112" end="00:32:16.812" style="s2">And the Wolf Clan has even sent members</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.812" end="00:32:18.312" style="s2">of its council of elders to plead on his</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.812" end="00:32:19.812" style="s2">behalf.</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.312" end="00:32:21.312" style="s2">Driving them away again would make our</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.812" end="00:32:23.512" style="s2">Sinclair family look cold and</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.312" end="00:32:25.412" style="s2">unreasonable.</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.512" end="00:32:27.012" style="s2">He still has not given up.</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.412" end="00:32:28.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought I made my position clear</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.012" end="00:32:30.312" style="s2">enough at the wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.312" end="00:32:32.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not only has he not given up, he says</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.312" end="00:32:33.212" style="s2">that if he cannot see you, he will never</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.212" end="00:32:34.812" style="s2">stop.</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.212" end="00:32:36.212" style="s2">That he would rather die at the Manor</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.812" end="00:32:38.012" style="s2">gates.</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.212" end="00:32:39.813" style="s2">The Clan elders fear things will turn</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.012" end="00:32:43.013" style="s2">too ugly, which is why they urgently</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.813" end="00:32:43.013" style="s2">called you back to handle it.</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.313" end="00:32:47.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria,</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.113" end="00:32:49.313" style="s2">you need not soften your heart. We will</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.113" end="00:32:51.513" style="s2">always stand by your decision.</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.313" end="00:32:52.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, mum, thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.513" end="00:32:54.813" style="s2">Whatever feelings I had for him were</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.913" end="00:32:58.413" style="s2">extinguished at the wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.813" end="00:32:58.413" style="s2">I shall return at once to deal with it.</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.913" end="00:33:02.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He just will not stop.</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.613" end="00:33:04.513" style="s2">Putting on that lovesick act now makes</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.213" end="00:33:06.513" style="s2">me sick.</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.513" end="00:33:07.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever he intends to do, you need not</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.513" end="00:33:10.113" style="s2">face it alone.</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.813" end="00:33:11.613" style="s2">Since you have made up your mind,</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.113" end="00:33:14.013" style="s2">let us settle this trouble together once</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.613" end="00:33:14.013" style="s2">and for all.</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.913" end="00:33:19.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.813" end="00:33:19.213" style="s2">Let us go.</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.213" end="00:33:33.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria,</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.913" end="00:33:35.458" style="s2">the two of you,</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.613" end="00:33:36.613" style="s2">why have you come back together?</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.458" end="00:33:38.113" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.613" end="00:33:40.013" style="s2">I have been begging at your door every</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.113" end="00:33:41.413" style="s2">day for you, throwing away my dignity in</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.013" end="00:33:45.913" style="s2">the hope that you would come back. And</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.413" end="00:33:45.913" style="s2">you, YOU ACTUALLY DARE TO BETRAY ME.</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.313" end="00:33:52.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WATCH HOW YOU SPEAK TO HER, DARIUS.</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.713" end="00:33:55.513" style="s2">Must the elf king also meddle in matters</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.713" end="00:33:56.513" style="s2">between my wife and me?</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.513" end="00:33:57.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wife?</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.513" end="00:33:59.813" style="s2">Darius,</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.813" end="00:34:01.213" style="s2">you are the one who betrayed first. We</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.813" end="00:34:02.913" style="s2">have had nothing to do with each other</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.213" end="00:34:05.113" style="s2">for a long time.</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.913" end="00:34:05.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You!</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.813" end="00:34:11.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Caelus,</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.913" end="00:34:13.113" style="s2">leave it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.513" end="00:34:16.313" style="s2">Raising a hand against the likes of him</p>
<p begin="00:34:13.113" end="00:34:16.313" style="s2">would only soil your hands.</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.513" end="00:34:22.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Indeed, there is no need.</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.013" end="00:34:24.213" style="s2">After all, as I recall,</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.413" end="00:34:25.893" style="s2">was it not I who accepted Lumeria&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.213" end="00:34:25.913" style="s2">proposal at the wedding?</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.893" end="00:34:27.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.913" end="00:34:30.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You too.</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.913" end="00:34:31.613" style="s2">If you cannot win Lumeria back, then you</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.213" end="00:34:33.098" style="s2">can forget about this seat of</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.613" end="00:34:35.118" style="s2">succession.</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.098" end="00:34:35.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.113" end="00:34:40.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria,</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.713" end="00:34:41.913" style="s2">I was too impulsive just now.</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.313" end="00:34:43.914" style="s2">Only in these past few days without you</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.913" end="00:34:45.014" style="s2">did realize that the one I truly love is</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.914" end="00:34:46.414" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.014" end="00:34:49.714" style="s2">Seeing you with someone else drove me</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.414" end="00:34:49.714" style="s2">nearly mad with jealousy.</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.114" end="00:34:53.914" style="s2">What happened at the wedding was my</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.214" end="00:34:55.214" style="s2">fault, and I truly know I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.914" end="00:34:58.814" style="s2">As long as you are willing to forgive</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.214" end="00:34:58.814" style="s2">me, I will do anything.</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.914" end="00:35:05.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumiria,</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.314" end="00:35:08.314" style="s2">I promise my Luna will only ever be you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.914" end="00:35:10.314" style="s2">Let us start over, all right?</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.314" end="00:35:13.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Say your peace and then get out, taking</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.314" end="00:35:13.114" style="s2">your things with you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.314" end="00:35:17.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumiria, you</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.314" end="00:35:19.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All your words have done is move</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.714" end="00:35:21.314" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.214" end="00:35:23.014" style="s2">You have no idea why I am hurt, why I am</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.314" end="00:35:25.914" style="s2">angry. You even think all I care about</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.014" end="00:35:25.914" style="s2">is the title of Luna.</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.314" end="00:35:30.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that not the case?</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.014" end="00:35:32.414" style="s2">Luminaya, you are only this stubborn</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.814" end="00:35:34.214" style="s2">because you have found someone new and</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.414" end="00:35:35.514" style="s2">look down on me now.</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.214" end="00:35:38.714" style="s2">Do you truly believe he would marry a</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.514" end="00:35:38.714" style="s2">woman I have abandoned?</p>
<p begin="00:35:39.614" end="00:35:45.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is none of your concern.</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.414" end="00:35:47.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumiria, you will regret this.</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.814" end="00:35:49.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that so?</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.214" end="00:35:51.814" style="s2">But Kalith is a thousand times, ten</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.614" end="00:35:53.314" style="s2">thousand times better than you, and</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.814" end="00:35:56.314" style="s2">spending even one more second with you</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.314" end="00:35:56.314" style="s2">makes me feel sick.</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.914" end="00:36:02.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, you heard my queen.</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.614" end="00:36:02.914" style="s2">Get out now.</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.414" end="00:36:06.765" style="s2">I</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.414" end="00:36:08.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop arguing, both of you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.765" end="00:36:09.914" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.614" end="00:36:12.314" style="s2">Lumiria,</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.914" end="00:36:13.814" style="s2">everything at the wedding was my fault.</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.314" end="00:36:14.914" style="s2">I shall return this moon crown to you</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.814" end="00:36:16.414" style="s2">now,</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.914" end="00:36:18.814" style="s2">for it has always belonged to you from</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.414" end="00:36:20.514" style="s2">the very beginning.</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.814" end="00:36:22.114" style="s2">Lumiria, you do not know.</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.514" end="00:36:23.414" style="s2">These past few days, for the sake of</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.114" end="00:36:24.914" style="s2">winning your forgiveness, Darius has</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.414" end="00:36:26.814" style="s2">barely eaten or slept, and even in his</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.914" end="00:36:28.814" style="s2">dreams he begs for your forgiveness.</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.814" end="00:36:31.614" style="s2">He truly cares about you, so please stop</p>
<p begin="00:36:28.814" end="00:36:31.614" style="s2">being angry with him.</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.314" end="00:36:38.414" style="s2">Once you marry Darius,</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.014" end="00:36:39.614" style="s2">if you still cannot stand the sight of</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.414" end="00:36:42.614" style="s2">me,</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.614" end="00:36:42.614" style="s2">I shall quietly leave.</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.714" end="00:36:45.816" style="s2">I do not want to come between the two of</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.216" end="00:36:47.516" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.816" end="00:36:49.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aria, Lumiria is by no means a</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.516" end="00:36:52.516" style="s2">narrow-minded person.</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.416" end="00:36:52.516" style="s2">She would never treat you that way.</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.116" end="00:36:57.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As the person actually concerned, I do</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.116" end="00:36:59.116" style="s2">not recall having forgiven anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.716" end="00:37:02.316" style="s2">Yet the two of you have already arranged</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.116" end="00:37:02.316" style="s2">everything on my behalf.</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.716" end="00:37:06.016" style="s2">But Lumisha, you and Darius are</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.416" end="00:37:07.516" style="s2">acknowledged by everyone as the Alpha</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.016" end="00:37:09.416" style="s2">and Luna.</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.516" end="00:37:12.416" style="s2">If you do not marry him, where else</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.416" end="00:37:12.416" style="s2">could you possibly go?</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.616" end="00:37:18.916" style="s2">I know you are still angry and want to</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.116" end="00:37:20.616" style="s2">make Darius jealous.</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.916" end="00:37:22.916" style="s2">But Lumiria, you must not play such a</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.616" end="00:37:24.916" style="s2">joke on Lord Elf King.</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.916" end="00:37:26.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never joke.</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.916" end="00:37:29.416" style="s2">Lumiria is the queen I have chosen for</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.816" end="00:37:29.416" style="s2">this life.</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.016" end="00:37:36.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, is Lumiria still angry with me?</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.116" end="00:37:39.116" style="s2">Is that why she deliberately says such</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.616" end="00:37:41.116" style="s2">things to provoke you?</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.116" end="00:37:43.616" style="s2">You two were so good together. How can</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.116" end="00:37:46.216" style="s2">she be so cruel?</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.616" end="00:37:47.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumiria, it was just a wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.216" end="00:37:49.116" style="s2">Do you really need to go this far just</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.716" end="00:37:50.316" style="s2">to spite me?</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.116" end="00:37:53.116" style="s2">Can you not spare a thought for the</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.316" end="00:37:57.316" style="s2">years of feelings we have shared?</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.116" end="00:37:58.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, you are truly selfish.</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.316" end="00:38:01.016" style="s2">At the wedding, you grandly announced to</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.916" end="00:38:02.416" style="s2">everyone that Aria was your true fated</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.016" end="00:38:04.616" style="s2">mate. Did you spare a thought for me</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.416" end="00:38:06.416" style="s2">then?</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.616" end="00:38:08.516" style="s2">And now you use our feelings to threaten</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.416" end="00:38:08.516" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.516" end="00:38:13.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumiria, I just do not want things</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.916" end="00:38:16.216" style="s2">between us to end like this.</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.116" end="00:38:17.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Between us? What is left between us?</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.216" end="00:38:21.416" style="s2">Nothing but your betrayal and my</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.616" end="00:38:23.116" style="s2">foolishness. Just because I loved you.</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.416" end="00:38:25.116" style="s2">Am I supposed to watch my future husband</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.116" end="00:38:26.816" style="s2">hand the moon crown to another woman and</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.116" end="00:38:30.116" style="s2">even let her deliver the speech in place</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.816" end="00:38:32.516" style="s2">of me, the bride?</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.116" end="00:38:34.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back then, I only pitied Aria because as</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.516" end="00:38:36.116" style="s2">my fated mate, I could not give her what</p>
<p begin="00:38:34.516" end="00:38:38.316" style="s2">she deserved.</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.116" end="00:38:40.916" style="s2">I was momentarily blinded.</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.316" end="00:38:42.416" style="s2">But the one I have always loved is you.</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.916" end="00:38:44.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then how do you explain forcing me to</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.416" end="00:38:46.016" style="s2">perform the soul blessing?</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.216" end="00:38:48.517" style="s2">And after I refused, you even went so</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.016" end="00:38:50.917" style="s2">far as to humiliate me. Darius, where</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.517" end="00:38:52.917" style="s2">was that love for me then?</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.917" end="00:38:52.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I.</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.217" end="00:38:56.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This was the wedding I had looked</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.417" end="00:38:59.817" style="s2">forward to with all my heart</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.717" end="00:39:02.017" style="s2">and you have ruined all of it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.817" end="00:39:04.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Lumira, we can hold another one. I</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.017" end="00:39:07.217" style="s2">promise. This time I will give you a</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.317" end="00:39:09.717" style="s2">wedding that satisfies you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.217" end="00:39:11.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumira, do not blame Darius.</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.717" end="00:39:14.217" style="s2">As long as you can forgive him I I shall</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.417" end="00:39:14.217" style="s2">leave this instant.</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.417" end="00:39:18.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aria.</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.417" end="00:39:24.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, why do you not hurry up and get</p>
<p begin="00:39:21.717" end="00:39:24.217" style="s2">out with her?</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.517" end="00:39:29.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let [snorts] me go.</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.017" end="00:39:33.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumira, I have already lowered myself</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.617" end="00:39:36.117" style="s2">this far. Must you keep clinging to my</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.417" end="00:39:39.317" style="s2">one moment of foolishness? One day I</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.117" end="00:39:39.317" style="s2">will make you regret this.</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.817" end="00:39:47.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, why have only the two of you</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.717" end="00:39:50.017" style="s2">come back?</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.117" end="00:39:50.017" style="s2">Where is Lumira?</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.717" end="00:39:56.217" style="s2">She loves you so much.</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.717" end="00:39:58.417" style="s2">Before she would forgive you the moment</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.217" end="00:39:59.617" style="s2">you apologized.</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.417" end="00:40:00.917" style="s2">Why did she not come back with you</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.617" end="00:40:03.917" style="s2">today?</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.917" end="00:40:05.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not even mention it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.917" end="00:40:06.917" style="s2">She will not listen to a word I say. It</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.617" end="00:40:08.117" style="s2">is as if she has become a different</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.917" end="00:40:10.017" style="s2">person.</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.117" end="00:40:12.617" style="s2">And you, Aria, why did you have to run</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.017" end="00:40:12.617" style="s2">your mouth?</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.717" end="00:40:15.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius,</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.117" end="00:40:16.817" style="s2">I.</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.217" end="00:40:18.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You knew perfectly well that Lumira and</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.817" end="00:40:20.117" style="s2">I were quarreling because of you and yet</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.417" end="00:40:23.017" style="s2">you suddenly ran off. What was Lumira</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.117" end="00:40:23.017" style="s2">supposed to think?</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.017" end="00:40:28.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am sorry, Darius.</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.817" end="00:40:31.817" style="s2">I thought that if I left you and Lumira</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.517" end="00:40:34.517" style="s2">could go back to the way things were.</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.817" end="00:40:36.117" style="s2">I am sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:40:34.517" end="00:40:39.317" style="s2">I just could not bear to watch you</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.117" end="00:40:41.617" style="s2">suffer so much, Darius.</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.317" end="00:40:43.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once Lumira is willing to marry me again</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.617" end="00:40:45.817" style="s2">you are not allowed to do this anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.517" end="00:40:48.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand, Darius.</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.817" end="00:40:50.418" style="s2">From now on I will do whatever you say.</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.117" end="00:40:52.718" style="s2">Please do not be with me.</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.418" end="00:40:56.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back then, my husband&#39;s soul was also</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.718" end="00:40:58.918" style="s2">stolen away by a so-called fated mate.</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.418" end="00:41:01.918" style="s2">That wretch relying on fate&#39;s bay foot</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.918" end="00:41:03.418" style="s2">made me suffer endless humiliation.</p>
<p begin="00:41:01.918" end="00:41:05.118" style="s2">I really do not know what Lumiria is</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.418" end="00:41:06.918" style="s2">concerned satisfied about.</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.118" end="00:41:08.018" style="s2">Even after finding your fated mate, you</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.918" end="00:41:09.618" style="s2">are still willing to honor your</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.018" end="00:41:11.318" style="s2">engagement with her.</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.618" end="00:41:13.018" style="s2">It is her honor.</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.318" end="00:41:14.618" style="s2">Given your standing, what harm is there</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.018" end="00:41:16.018" style="s2">in keeping an extra plaything around to</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.618" end="00:41:17.618" style="s2">relieve boredom?</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.018" end="00:41:20.618" style="s2">For her to make such an ugly fuss is</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.618" end="00:41:20.618" style="s2">truly ungrateful.</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.918" end="00:41:27.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am Darius&#39;s fated mate, the future</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.518" end="00:41:30.618" style="s2">Luna. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.018" end="00:41:32.958" style="s2">How dare she humiliate me like this?</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.618" end="00:41:33.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, do not say that.</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.958" end="00:41:35.118" style="s2">[gasps and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.518" end="00:41:38.318" style="s2">I have never treated Aria as some</p>
<p begin="00:41:35.118" end="00:41:38.318" style="s2">plaything for amusement.</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.718" end="00:41:43.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Say what you will.</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.118" end="00:41:45.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The point now is not this at all. It is</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.718" end="00:41:47.218" style="s2">Lumiria.</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.403" end="00:41:48.518" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.218" end="00:41:52.118" style="s2">Without the Sinclair family support,</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.518" end="00:41:52.118" style="s2">what becomes of my right of succession?</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.018" end="00:41:57.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From what you say, what she cares about</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.518" end="00:41:59.018" style="s2">is simply that ruined wedding, is it</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.918" end="00:42:00.918" style="s2">not?</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.018" end="00:42:02.518" style="s2">Lumiria is only angry that we neglected</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.918" end="00:42:05.018" style="s2">her for Aria&#39;s sake and made her feel we</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.518" end="00:42:05.918" style="s2">did not value her enough.</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.018" end="00:42:07.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.918" end="00:42:09.318" style="s2">then how exactly am I to win Lumiria&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.818" end="00:42:12.818" style="s2">forgiveness?</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.318" end="00:42:12.818" style="s2">By holding an even grander wedding?</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.918" end="00:42:16.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The betrothal between the witches and</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.518" end="00:42:18.118" style="s2">our wolf clan has been passed down for</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.218" end="00:42:21.218" style="s2">generations. It is not something the elf</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.118" end="00:42:22.718" style="s2">king can cancel simply by interfering.</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.218" end="00:42:24.918" style="s2">Lumiria is merely putting on a brave</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.718" end="00:42:26.618" style="s2">face.</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.918" end="00:42:27.818" style="s2">As long as we show a little sincerity,</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.618" end="00:42:30.418" style="s2">she will ultimately marry you</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.818" end="00:42:30.418" style="s2">obediently.</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.418" end="00:42:35.618" style="s2">Have people prepare a wedding ceremony</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.118" end="00:42:38.718" style="s2">of the highest standard at once and make</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.618" end="00:42:40.918" style="s2">sure the pomp and sincerity are ample.</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.718" end="00:42:42.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But today she</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.918" end="00:42:44.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is because you took Aria along</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.418" end="00:42:47.118" style="s2">today and annoyed her.</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.718" end="00:42:51.018" style="s2">Aria did not mean it either.</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.118" end="00:42:51.018" style="s2">Tomorrow, leave her behind at the manor.</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.718" end="00:42:54.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very well.</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.620" end="00:42:57.720" style="s2">As long as it can soothe Lumera&#39;s anger</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.220" end="00:42:59.220" style="s2">and help Darius, I am willing to do</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.720" end="00:43:00.820" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.220" end="00:43:03.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow I shall personally accompany</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.820" end="00:43:04.820" style="s2">you to apologize to Lumera. I refuse to</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.320" end="00:43:07.820" style="s2">believe that Lumera would dare put on</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.820" end="00:43:07.820" style="s2">axes before us.</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.720" end="00:43:14.720" style="s2">Lumeria, look.</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.020" end="00:43:16.220" style="s2">This is the wedding preparation plan</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.720" end="00:43:17.920" style="s2">Darius personally worked through the</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.220" end="00:43:20.120" style="s2">night to produce.</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.920" end="00:43:21.820" style="s2">This time the budget has been doubled,</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.120" end="00:43:23.120" style="s2">and he personally oversaw everything</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.820" end="00:43:24.720" style="s2">from the venue arrangements to your</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.120" end="00:43:28.120" style="s2">wedding dress.</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.720" end="00:43:28.120" style="s2">I promise you will be satisfied.</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.790" end="00:43:36.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.320" end="00:43:39.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is nothing left to discuss about</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.820" end="00:43:41.020" style="s2">this matter.</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.220" end="00:43:42.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria, I know Darius was in the wrong</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.020" end="00:43:43.920" style="s2">at the wedding, that his head was</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.520" end="00:43:45.320" style="s2">muddled and he failed to consider your</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.920" end="00:43:46.820" style="s2">feelings.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.320" end="00:43:48.420" style="s2">But you two have had so many years of</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.820" end="00:43:50.120" style="s2">affection between you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.420" end="00:43:53.420" style="s2">For the sake of the past, please forgive</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.120" end="00:43:53.420" style="s2">him just this once, all right?</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.320" end="00:43:59.120" style="s2">What happened at the wedding is not</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.720" end="00:44:02.520" style="s2">something a single word like</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.120" end="00:44:02.520" style="s2">muddleheaded can brush away.</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.820" end="00:44:06.020" style="s2">You wretch.</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.320" end="00:44:07.420" style="s2">At home you could not wait to bear your</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.020" end="00:44:10.520" style="s2">heart to her, so why have you turned</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.420" end="00:44:12.020" style="s2">coward the moment you meet her?</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.520" end="00:44:14.220" style="s2">Tell her all those heartfelt plans of</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.020" end="00:44:16.720" style="s2">yours.</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.220" end="00:44:19.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria, I truly know I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.720" end="00:44:21.720" style="s2">I have thought it through completely.</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.320" end="00:44:23.120" style="s2">Without you I cannot go on living.</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.720" end="00:44:25.420" style="s2">Believe me, I will treat you well from</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.120" end="00:44:28.420" style="s2">now on.</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.420" end="00:44:31.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is no need to prepare any wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.420" end="00:44:33.420" style="s2">In the end she cannot do without Darius.</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.420" end="00:44:34.520" style="s2">A few words and she comes clinging back</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.420" end="00:44:37.520" style="s2">eagerly,</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.520" end="00:44:39.620" style="s2">so easily preplayed it makes one laugh.</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.520" end="00:44:41.220" style="s2">I knew our Lumeria was the most sensible</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.620" end="00:44:43.620" style="s2">of all.</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.220" end="00:44:46.020" style="s2">Rest assured, although Ara is the fated</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.620" end="00:44:47.420" style="s2">mate, the one Darius deeply loves is</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.020" end="00:44:49.220" style="s2">still you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.420" end="00:44:51.120" style="s2">I guarantee that girl will not affect</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.220" end="00:44:53.220" style="s2">you in the slightest.</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.120" end="00:44:55.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, yes, yes.</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.220" end="00:44:56.721" style="s2">Lumeria, my feelings for you have never</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.321" end="00:44:59.921" style="s2">changed.</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.721" end="00:44:59.921" style="s2">Let us never be a part, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.021" end="00:45:05.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rowena,</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.321" end="00:45:06.721" style="s2">where were you during the wedding?</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.121" end="00:45:08.321" style="s2">I was busy at the time. It stopped the</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.721" end="00:45:10.121" style="s2">act.</p>
<p begin="00:45:08.321" end="00:45:11.721" style="s2">No matter how sweetly you speak now, you</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.121" end="00:45:13.821" style="s2">cannot erase the fact that when I was</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.721" end="00:45:17.121" style="s2">humiliated in public, you hid in the</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.821" end="00:45:17.121" style="s2">background playing dead.</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.921" end="00:45:22.121" style="s2">To see you humiliated,</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.021" end="00:45:24.721" style="s2">my heart knows only an indescribable</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.121" end="00:45:24.721" style="s2">delight.</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.021" end="00:45:31.221" style="s2">Why can you,</p>
<p begin="00:45:29.421" end="00:45:35.121" style="s2">who are clearly not Darius&#39;s fainted</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.221" end="00:45:36.921" style="s2">mate, win my son&#39;s true heart?</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.121" end="00:45:38.721" style="s2">Why did my husband abandon me without</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.921" end="00:45:41.121" style="s2">mercy the moment he met his fainted</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.721" end="00:45:41.121" style="s2">mate?</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.921" end="00:45:50.721" style="s2">So when Aria, the true fainted mate,</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.321" end="00:45:53.421" style="s2">appeared and Lumira was at last cast</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.721" end="00:45:56.521" style="s2">aside and betrayed like rubbish, I felt</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.421" end="00:46:00.121" style="s2">nothing but sheer delight.</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.521" end="00:46:00.121" style="s2">Lumiria, I was in the wrong before.</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.221" end="00:46:03.321" style="s2">Had I known Aria would go so far, I</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.021" end="00:46:04.321" style="s2">would never have let her appear at your</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.321" end="00:46:05.821" style="s2">wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.321" end="00:46:07.921" style="s2">Surely you must give us a chance to make</p>
<p begin="00:46:05.821" end="00:46:08.921" style="s2">it up to you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.921" end="00:46:10.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumiria,</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.921" end="00:46:13.521" style="s2">are you truly going to throw away the</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.321" end="00:46:13.521" style="s2">years of feeling between us?</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.621" end="00:46:18.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, you are revolting.</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.121" end="00:46:21.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumiria, believe me,</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.821" end="00:46:23.321" style="s2">I am sincerely repentant.</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.721" end="00:46:24.521" style="s2">The person I have always wanted to spend</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.321" end="00:46:25.821" style="s2">my life with</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.521" end="00:46:28.321" style="s2">is you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.821" end="00:46:30.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not touch my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.321" end="00:46:32.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, how dare scum like you speak of</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.421" end="00:46:33.921" style="s2">spending your life with me?</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.421" end="00:46:36.521" style="s2">I could never tolerate a husband of your</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.921" end="00:46:38.921" style="s2">kind because you disgust me.</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.521" end="00:46:41.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumaria, do not go too far.</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.921" end="00:46:43.221" style="s2">A werewolf famed for loyalty, yet you</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.021" end="00:46:46.221" style="s2">shamelessly two-time like this. It is</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.221" end="00:46:46.221" style="s2">truly revolting.</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.921" end="00:46:49.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.221" end="00:46:57.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumiria, this is all your fault.</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.521" end="00:46:58.422" style="s2">You could not hold my son&#39;s heart.</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.221" end="00:47:00.823" style="s2">Why can you not be a little more</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.422" end="00:47:02.122" style="s2">magnanimous?</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.823" end="00:47:04.122" style="s2">You know better than anyone what it</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.122" end="00:47:06.023" style="s2">feels like to be betrayed, yet you still</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.122" end="00:47:08.422" style="s2">indulge your son in doing the very same</p>
<p begin="00:47:06.023" end="00:47:08.422" style="s2">thing.</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.523" end="00:47:12.723" style="s2">I truly pity you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.223" end="00:47:15.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHUT UP!</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.723" end="00:47:18.523" style="s2">WHAT RIGHT HAVE YOU TO PITY ME?</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.122" end="00:47:20.823" style="s2">You are not even Darius&#39;s fated mate.</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.523" end="00:47:21.922" style="s2">That fated mate of Darius&#39;s, what is she</p>
<p begin="00:47:20.823" end="00:47:25.823" style="s2">even?</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.922" end="00:47:28.323" style="s2">My daughter would not spare her a glass.</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.823" end="00:47:30.023" style="s2">Darius is the Wolf Clan&#39;s future alpha,</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.323" end="00:47:31.023" style="s2">and for Lumiria to marry him is her</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.023" end="00:47:33.023" style="s2">honor.</p>
<p begin="00:47:31.023" end="00:47:35.622" style="s2">She ought to know her place, graciously</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.023" end="00:47:37.422" style="s2">accept Aria rather than disgrace herself</p>
<p begin="00:47:35.622" end="00:47:39.122" style="s2">here like a jealous shrew.</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.422" end="00:47:40.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rowena, enough!</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.122" end="00:47:42.922" style="s2">Since you treasure that fated mate so</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.723" end="00:47:44.323" style="s2">dearly, take your precious son and get</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.922" end="00:47:46.968" style="s2">out and never come begging to my</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.323" end="00:47:47.422" style="s2">daughter again.</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.968" end="00:47:50.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.422" end="00:47:52.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take your things and get out at once.</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.723" end="00:47:53.622" style="s2">You are only afraid the Council of</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.223" end="00:47:55.422" style="s2">Elders will learn that you lost the</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.622" end="00:47:57.823" style="s2">Sinclair family support because of your</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.422" end="00:47:59.922" style="s2">fated mate and so strip you of your</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.823" end="00:48:01.422" style="s2">right of succession.</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.922" end="00:48:02.723" style="s2">You came crawling to me today not out of</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.422" end="00:48:05.122" style="s2">guilt, but because you need my family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.723" end="00:48:06.523" style="s2">power to hold on to your alpha throne.</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.122" end="00:48:08.122" style="s2">Darius, you want me to swallow my</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.523" end="00:48:11.422" style="s2">humiliation to satisfy you. It is</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.122" end="00:48:13.422" style="s2">selfish to the point of nausea.</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.422" end="00:48:15.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You shut up!</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.422" end="00:48:18.023" style="s2">How long will you keep bowing to that</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.223" end="00:48:21.023" style="s2">ungrateful wretch? Do you not see yet?</p>
<p begin="00:48:18.023" end="00:48:22.523" style="s2">She has latched onto the elf king and is</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.023" end="00:48:24.622" style="s2">humiliating us.</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.523" end="00:48:26.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Humiliation? I have merely repaid one</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.622" end="00:48:29.723" style="s2">ten thousandth of the humiliation you</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.122" end="00:48:29.723" style="s2">have inflicted on me all these years.</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.023" end="00:48:33.422" style="s2">Very well.</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.422" end="00:48:34.823" style="s2">Lumiria, remember your words today.</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.422" end="00:48:36.823" style="s2">Sooner or later you will come crawling</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.823" end="00:48:38.823" style="s2">to beg our Wolf Clan&#39;s forgiveness, and</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.823" end="00:48:40.523" style="s2">when that time comes, we will not spare</p>
<p begin="00:48:38.823" end="00:48:43.023" style="s2">you a SINGLE GLASS.</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.523" end="00:48:43.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MOM!</p>
<p begin="00:48:44.023" end="00:48:47.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let us go.</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.723" end="00:48:48.922" style="s2">There is no need to stay here and endure</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.523" end="00:48:50.223" style="s2">her sneers.</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.922" end="00:48:52.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumiria,</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.223" end="00:48:54.622" style="s2">listen to me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.023" end="00:48:54.622" style="s2">Lumiria!</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.823" end="00:49:01.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kaelith rushed back to the elf territory</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.523" end="00:49:03.424" style="s2">at first light, saying mysteriously that</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.624" end="00:49:05.424" style="s2">he had a surprise for me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.424" end="00:49:07.924" style="s2">Why is he not returned yet?</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.424" end="00:49:07.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Missed me?</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.924" end="00:49:12.724" style="s2">Open it and see.</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.524" end="00:49:16.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is this?</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.724" end="00:49:21.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the fruit of the tree of life,</p>
<p begin="00:49:19.724" end="00:49:23.424" style="s2">which bears fruit only once in a</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.224" end="00:49:25.124" style="s2">thousand years. It will greatly help</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.424" end="00:49:26.924" style="s2">restore your core. [music] When I heard</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.124" end="00:49:27.724" style="s2">of it this morning, I had no choice but</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.924" end="00:49:30.924" style="s2">to leave in haste.</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.724" end="00:49:33.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is far too precious, Caelith.</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.924" end="00:49:34.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It exists for you alone. Do not refuse</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.424" end="00:49:36.924" style="s2">me, Lumiria.</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.424" end="00:49:36.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But this</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.224" end="00:49:42.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have already accepted my blood. What</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.524" end="00:49:43.724" style="s2">is a single fruit by comparison? Or</p>
<p begin="00:49:42.224" end="00:49:45.624" style="s2">perhaps</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.724" end="00:49:48.424" style="s2">rather than this fruit</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.624" end="00:49:50.424" style="s2">you would prefer to drink my blood?</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.424" end="00:49:53.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:49:50.424" end="00:49:53.324" style="s2">I shall accept it then.</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.624" end="00:49:58.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My leaving forced you to face that clan</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.224" end="00:50:00.324" style="s2">of lunatics from the wolf clan alone.</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.324" end="00:50:01.724" style="s2">Thank goodness you were not wronged.</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.324" end="00:50:03.324" style="s2">Otherwise the wolf clan should have had</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.724" end="00:50:04.924" style="s2">no reason to keep existing.</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.324" end="00:50:07.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then would I not become the culprit who</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.924" end="00:50:08.624" style="s2">sparked a great war between you?</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.124" end="00:50:09.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumiria, look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.624" end="00:50:11.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.624" end="00:50:13.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Among our elven kind, we are never</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.624" end="00:50:15.524" style="s2">manipulated by so-called fate, and we</p>
<p begin="00:50:13.924" end="00:50:17.324" style="s2">would never trample upon our vows with</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.524" end="00:50:19.824" style="s2">beastling instinct. We surrender our</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.324" end="00:50:21.924" style="s2">soul only once in a lifetime. I promise</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.824" end="00:50:23.924" style="s2">you, my choice and my loyalty spring</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.924" end="00:50:25.424" style="s2">entirely from my own heart.</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.924" end="00:50:28.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Caelith</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.424" end="00:50:28.224" style="s2">I believe you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.719" end="00:50:33.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.724" end="00:50:36.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn it. The suppressors is utterly</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.924" end="00:50:36.524" style="s2">useless.</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.824" end="00:50:40.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, I shall have people look for a</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.224" end="00:50:41.924" style="s2">more effective suppress. Surely it can</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.324" end="00:50:44.124" style="s2">hold your condition steady for the time</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.924" end="00:50:47.824" style="s2">being.</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.124" end="00:50:50.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is no use. Do you not understand yet?</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.824" end="00:50:52.324" style="s2">Apart from the moon elixir Lumiria brews</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.024" end="00:50:55.824" style="s2">with her own hands, no other potion can</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.324" end="00:50:55.824" style="s2">suppress my feral rage.</p>
<p begin="00:50:56.424" end="00:51:00.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, calm down.</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.324" end="00:51:02.124" style="s2">There must be some other way.</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.324" end="00:51:04.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What other way could there be? My</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.124" end="00:51:05.925" style="s2">condition is worsening by the day.</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.325" end="00:51:09.825" style="s2">At this rate, I will sooner or later</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.925" end="00:51:11.625" style="s2">turn completely into a mindless beast.</p>
<p begin="00:51:09.825" end="00:51:13.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did it come to this?</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.625" end="00:51:15.525" style="s2">I schemed so hard to take Lumaria&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.425" end="00:51:17.025" style="s2">place. If in the end he cannot become</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.525" end="00:51:19.925" style="s2">the wolf clan&#39;s chieftain, would not all</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.025" end="00:51:21.625" style="s2">my efforts be wasted? Absolutely not.</p>
<p begin="00:51:19.925" end="00:51:23.025" style="s2">That ungrateful woman.</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.625" end="00:51:24.725" style="s2">Once she sees how harsh the outside</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.025" end="00:51:27.225" style="s2">world is, she will come back to beg you</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.725" end="00:51:28.825" style="s2">soon enough.</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.225" end="00:51:31.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The problem now is not whether she comes</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.825" end="00:51:32.725" style="s2">back. Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.325" end="00:51:33.825" style="s2">we have lost the Sinclair family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.725" end="00:51:35.725" style="s2">resources.</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.825" end="00:51:36.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At worst, we can find another family to</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.725" end="00:51:38.525" style="s2">cooperate with.</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.525" end="00:51:40.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you think that is possible? Without</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.525" end="00:51:43.125" style="s2">Lumaria&#39;s support, the elders will never</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.825" end="00:51:45.625" style="s2">agree to let me succeed.</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.125" end="00:51:48.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They would not dare. You are the first</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.625" end="00:51:50.225" style="s2">in line to inherit.</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.625" end="00:51:51.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rightful succession.</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.225" end="00:51:53.325" style="s2">Those old foxes only care about who can</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.925" end="00:51:55.525" style="s2">bring the wolf clan the greatest</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.325" end="00:51:57.225" style="s2">benefit. Within the council of elders,</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.525" end="00:52:00.525" style="s2">someone has already formally proposed</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.225" end="00:52:00.525" style="s2">electing a new successor.</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.925" end="00:52:07.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those collateral branches have SIMPLY</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.225" end="00:52:09.325" style="s2">GONE TOO FAR.</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.225" end="00:52:11.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Usually they defer to me, but now that</p>
<p begin="00:52:09.325" end="00:52:14.325" style="s2">the tide has turned, they cannot wait to</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.225" end="00:52:16.725" style="s2">trample me down.</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.325" end="00:52:19.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, do not be too anxious. Whatever</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.725" end="00:52:21.625" style="s2">happens, I will stay by your side and</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.025" end="00:52:23.225" style="s2">help you find a way.</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.625" end="00:52:25.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you silence the council of elders</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.225" end="00:52:27.725" style="s2">for me or solve my feral rage?</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.525" end="00:52:27.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="00:52:30.225" end="00:52:33.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aria can give me no real help beyond her</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.225" end="00:52:35.625" style="s2">tears.</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.425" end="00:52:37.625" style="s2">And now I can only barely suppress my</p>
<p begin="00:52:35.625" end="00:52:39.425" style="s2">feral rage by relying on a trace of</p>
<p begin="00:52:37.625" end="00:52:41.325" style="s2">Lumaria&#39;s blood essence sealed in this</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.425" end="00:52:42.225" style="s2">ring.</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.325" end="00:52:44.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.225" end="00:52:46.625" style="s2">I have remembered something. Hope.</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.225" end="00:52:48.225" style="s2">Darius, there is still hope for you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.625" end="00:52:49.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what are you talking about? What</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.225" end="00:52:51.925" style="s2">turning point could there possibly be</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.625" end="00:52:51.925" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="00:52:55.925" end="00:53:00.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It must be here.</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.425" end="00:53:02.927" style="s2">I recall it arrived a few days ago, but</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.625" end="00:53:05.327" style="s2">I was busy with your affairs and left it</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.927" end="00:53:05.327" style="s2">around.</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.627" end="00:53:10.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not just stand there. Come and help</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.127" end="00:53:12.127" style="s2">me search.</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.927" end="00:53:13.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rowinda,</p>
<p begin="00:53:12.127" end="00:53:15.827" style="s2">what are we looking for?</p>
<p begin="00:53:13.427" end="00:53:17.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An invitation. As long as we find it,</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.827" end="00:53:20.227" style="s2">let us see who dares to touch Darius&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.727" end="00:53:20.227" style="s2">position.</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.727" end="00:53:29.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Found it.</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.127" end="00:53:30.727" style="s2">This is the one.</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.427" end="00:53:32.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what is this?</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.727" end="00:53:34.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius,</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.227" end="00:53:36.927" style="s2">this is the very thing that can save us.</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.527" end="00:53:41.127" style="s2">With it, the next wolf clan chieftain</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.927" end="00:53:41.127" style="s2">can only ever be you.</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.427" end="00:53:49.627" style="s2">Take a good look. With this,</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.027" end="00:53:51.152" style="s2">your position as successor is secure.</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.627" end="00:53:52.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother, whose invitation is this?</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.152" end="00:53:55.227" style="s2">[music] Can it truly hold the Council of</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.727" end="00:53:57.827" style="s2">Elders in check?</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.227" end="00:54:00.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rowina, has some elder agreed to step</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.827" end="00:54:02.127" style="s2">forward and support Darius? As expected,</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.527" end="00:54:03.827" style="s2">they too know that replacing Darius</p>
<p begin="00:54:02.127" end="00:54:07.027" style="s2">would be a loss to the wolf clan.</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.827" end="00:54:10.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As if they are worthy. Look closely.</p>
<p begin="00:54:07.027" end="00:54:13.727" style="s2">This is an invitation from Lord Astor.</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.927" end="00:54:15.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lord Astor, that mysterious magment whom</p>
<p begin="00:54:13.727" end="00:54:16.627" style="s2">even the Council of Elders must treat</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.327" end="00:54:18.827" style="s2">with deference? There was once a</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.627" end="00:54:20.427" style="s2">successor who won his favor, and with</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.827" end="00:54:22.027" style="s2">his help not only broke the elders&#39;</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.427" end="00:54:24.027" style="s2">balance of power to secure the alpha</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.027" end="00:54:25.527" style="s2">seat, but also led the wolf clan to</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.027" end="00:54:28.127" style="s2">annex the surrounding territories and</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.527" end="00:54:30.227" style="s2">usher in its most prosperous century.</p>
<p begin="00:54:28.127" end="00:54:32.127" style="s2">Could it be that I too</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.227" end="00:54:34.327" style="s2">have been chosen by this lord?</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.127" end="00:54:36.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Never mind the Council of</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.327" end="00:54:39.227" style="s2">Elders. Even that overhyped elf king</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.627" end="00:54:41.527" style="s2">must bow before Lord Astor. Subtu 3 is</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.227" end="00:54:43.827" style="s2">merely carrying an ancient empty title.</p>
<p begin="00:54:41.527" end="00:54:46.427" style="s2">How could he compare to Lord Astor?</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.827" end="00:54:49.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wonderful. With Lord Astor stepping in,</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.427" end="00:54:51.327" style="s2">what is a mere feed? Even without</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.027" end="00:54:53.527" style="s2">Lumiria, nothing can threaten my</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.327" end="00:54:55.127" style="s2">position as successor any longer.</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.527" end="00:54:57.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank goodness Darius can still be</p>
<p begin="00:54:55.127" end="00:54:59.827" style="s2">saved. As long as he wins Lord Astor&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:54:57.327" end="00:55:02.327" style="s2">support, he remains alpha and I remain</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.827" end="00:55:04.513" style="s2">Luna. Having come this far, I must not</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.327" end="00:55:05.327" style="s2">let it all go to waste.</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.513" end="00:55:07.128" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.327" end="00:55:09.528" style="s2">Darius is truly remarkable to have</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.128" end="00:55:11.928" style="s2">obtained Lord Astor&#39;s invitation.</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.528" end="00:55:13.928" style="s2">He must think highly of your potential.</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.928" end="00:55:15.828" style="s2">Once you win his support,</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.928" end="00:55:19.328" style="s2">make sure everyone who has looked down</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.828" end="00:55:19.328" style="s2">on us pays the price.</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.128" end="00:55:23.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.328" end="00:55:25.128" style="s2">Open it quickly and see the time and</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.128" end="00:55:26.428" style="s2">place of the banquet so we can prepare</p>
<p begin="00:55:25.128" end="00:55:27.928" style="s2">in advance.</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.428" end="00:55:31.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As long as I can make a connection with</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.928" end="00:55:31.328" style="s2">Lord Astor at the banquet.</p>
<p begin="00:55:34.728" end="00:55:40.228" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.028" end="00:55:44.228" style="s2">What is the meaning of this?</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.228" end="00:55:44.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it? Why such a fuss?</p>
<p begin="00:55:44.328" end="00:55:50.428" style="s2">You are cordially invited</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.728" end="00:55:51.673" style="s2">Lumaria and her fiancé.</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.428" end="00:55:54.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Should this invitation not be for</p>
<p begin="00:55:51.673" end="00:55:54.028" style="s2">[music] me?</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.328" end="00:55:59.028" style="s2">Why?</p>
<p begin="00:55:57.428" end="00:55:59.728" style="s2">Why does it bear Lumaria&#39;s name but not</p>
<p begin="00:55:59.028" end="00:56:01.828" style="s2">mine?</p>
<p begin="00:55:59.728" end="00:56:03.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumaria again. Why does every great</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.828" end="00:56:05.128" style="s2">figure favor her so?</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.528" end="00:56:07.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She has already publicly called off the</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.128" end="00:56:09.328" style="s2">engagement. Does Lord Astor not know?</p>
<p begin="00:56:07.528" end="00:56:11.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But if we do not attend this banquet and</p>
<p begin="00:56:09.328" end="00:56:14.228" style="s2">fail to win Lord Astor&#39;s support,</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.928" end="00:56:16.428" style="s2">your position as successor</p>
<p begin="00:56:14.228" end="00:56:17.928" style="s2">truly cannot be saved.</p>
<p begin="00:56:16.428" end="00:56:19.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If Darius loses his standing as</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.928" end="00:56:20.528" style="s2">successor,</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.128" end="00:56:22.458" style="s2">I too shall lose all my wealth and</p>
<p begin="00:56:20.528" end="00:56:24.478" style="s2">luxury.</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.458" end="00:56:24.478" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.528" end="00:56:27.728" style="s2">Darius.</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.728" end="00:56:29.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rowena, do not panic.</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.728" end="00:56:32.128" style="s2">Since the invitation is now in our</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.328" end="00:56:34.028" style="s2">hands, this is our opportunity. I can</p>
<p begin="00:56:32.128" end="00:56:35.128" style="s2">help.</p>
<p begin="00:56:34.028" end="00:56:36.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help?</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.128" end="00:56:39.228" style="s2">It says Lumaria and her fiancé are</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.928" end="00:56:41.128" style="s2">invited. How are we supposed to attend?</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.228" end="00:56:43.628" style="s2">Am I to go beg that damned caliph to</p>
<p begin="00:56:41.128" end="00:56:44.528" style="s2">give me his place?</p>
<p begin="00:56:43.628" end="00:56:46.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.528" end="00:56:48.428" style="s2">There is no need to beg them. If there</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.328" end="00:56:50.228" style="s2">is no Lumaria, there is still me.</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.428" end="00:56:51.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What help can you possibly give?</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.228" end="00:56:54.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since the invitation is for Lumaria and</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.928" end="00:56:56.128" style="s2">her fiancé, I can attend disguised as</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.128" end="00:56:58.428" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:56:56.128" end="00:57:01.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absurd. Do you think this is child&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:56:58.428" end="00:57:03.328" style="s2">play? If I am discovered, I am finished.</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.528" end="00:57:04.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But Darius, if we do not take this</p>
<p begin="00:57:03.328" end="00:57:06.928" style="s2">gamble, the Council of Elders will</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.828" end="00:57:08.328" style="s2">depose you very soon. As long as we can</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.928" end="00:57:10.829" style="s2">sneak in and get you Lord Astor&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.328" end="00:57:12.029" style="s2">support, even if someone discovers us,</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.829" end="00:57:12.829" style="s2">who could change the fact that you were</p>
<p begin="00:57:12.029" end="00:57:14.829" style="s2">chosen?</p>
<p begin="00:57:12.829" end="00:57:16.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you take Lord Athop for some fool you</p>
<p begin="00:57:14.829" end="00:57:18.529" style="s2">can casually deceive?</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.429" end="00:57:19.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius,</p>
<p begin="00:57:18.529" end="00:57:21.829" style="s2">I only want to help you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.829" end="00:57:23.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are an ordinary human with no magic.</p>
<p begin="00:57:21.829" end="00:57:25.129" style="s2">You cannot even imitate a single trace</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.629" end="00:57:26.629" style="s2">of Lumera&#39;s aura.</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.129" end="00:57:27.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The likes of you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.629" end="00:57:29.429" style="s2">There would be no need to wait for Lord</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.929" end="00:57:30.929" style="s2">Astor. The moment you step through the</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.429" end="00:57:32.329" style="s2">door, everyone else would see through</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.929" end="00:57:34.129" style="s2">you at once.</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.329" end="00:57:35.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put away that ridiculous idea of yours</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.129" end="00:57:37.129" style="s2">at once.</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.529" end="00:57:40.229" style="s2">I absolutely will not agree to this</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.129" end="00:57:40.229" style="s2">suicidal proposal.</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.629" end="00:57:46.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, apart from this risky ploy of</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.429" end="00:57:48.229" style="s2">hers, do we have any better option?</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.529" end="00:57:49.729" style="s2">The Council of Elders has already lost</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.229" end="00:57:52.529" style="s2">patience with you</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.729" end="00:57:54.629" style="s2">without Lord Astor&#39;s support.</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.529" end="00:57:58.029" style="s2">Your right of succession may well be</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.629" end="00:57:59.529" style="s2">strict at next month&#39;s clan council.</p>
<p begin="00:57:58.029" end="00:58:01.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But Mom, can a figure of such immense</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.529" end="00:58:02.629" style="s2">power as Lord Astor really be fooled so</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.529" end="00:58:04.629" style="s2">easily?</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.629" end="00:58:06.229" style="s2">She is a human with no magic at all.</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.629" end="00:58:07.729" style="s2">Trying to impersonate Lumeria is walking</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.229" end="00:58:09.729" style="s2">straight to her death.</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.729" end="00:58:11.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if we could make her possess</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.729" end="00:58:13.829" style="s2">Lumeria&#39;s aura perfectly?</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.829" end="00:58:15.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you suggesting we use</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.829" end="00:58:18.829" style="s2">that forbidden transformation potion?</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.929" end="00:58:19.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Transformation potion? What exactly is</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.829" end="00:58:21.529" style="s2">that?</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.429" end="00:58:23.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is an ancient magical potion. Once</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.529" end="00:58:26.029" style="s2">you drink it, your appearance, your</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.529" end="00:58:27.429" style="s2">voice, even the magical aura you emit</p>
<p begin="00:58:26.029" end="00:58:29.629" style="s2">will become exactly the same as</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.429" end="00:58:31.529" style="s2">Lumeria&#39;s. With this disguise, even Lord</p>
<p begin="00:58:29.629" end="00:58:34.329" style="s2">Astor could never detect a thing.</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.529" end="00:58:35.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really? Then I am willing to drink it.</p>
<p begin="00:58:34.329" end="00:58:37.829" style="s2">As long as it helps Darius keep his</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.729" end="00:58:39.629" style="s2">position as successor, I am willing to</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.829" end="00:58:41.729" style="s2">do anything.</p>
<p begin="00:58:39.629" end="00:58:43.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolutely not. That potion not only</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.729" end="00:58:45.529" style="s2">requires extremely stringent</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.329" end="00:58:48.029" style="s2">ingredients, but more critically, its</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.529" end="00:58:50.329" style="s2">side effects are terribly dangerous. And</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.029" end="00:58:52.029" style="s2">once we are exposed, our entire family</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.329" end="00:58:53.229" style="s2">will face Lord Astor&#39;s wrath and be</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.029" end="00:58:55.529" style="s2">utterly destroyed.</p>
<p begin="00:58:53.229" end="00:58:57.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we do not try now, we are doomed in</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.529" end="00:59:00.429" style="s2">an instant. Do you think you still have</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.729" end="00:59:00.429" style="s2">a way out?</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.729" end="00:59:05.429" style="s2">Look at yourself now. Will you, with</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.729" end="00:59:07.429" style="s2">this body that could lose control at any</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.429" end="00:59:09.929" style="s2">moment, stand by and watch the alpha</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.429" end="00:59:10.829" style="s2">seat be snatched away by others?</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.929" end="00:59:12.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn it.</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.829" end="00:59:15.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So then, are you now prepared to pay</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.831" end="00:59:15.531" style="s2">with your life?</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.131" end="00:59:18.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.131" end="00:59:20.231" style="s2">As long as it helps Darius, I am willing</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.931" end="00:59:23.231" style="s2">to do anything.</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.231" end="00:59:25.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is no ordinary disguise magic.</p>
<p begin="00:59:23.231" end="00:59:26.931" style="s2">While the disguise lasts, every word you</p>
<p begin="00:59:25.131" end="00:59:29.131" style="s2">speak in Lumera&#39;s voice, even every</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.931" end="00:59:30.231" style="s2">single breath, will make your throat</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.131" end="00:59:32.831" style="s2">feel as though you have swallowed</p>
<p begin="00:59:30.231" end="00:59:32.831" style="s2">blades.</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.066" end="00:59:37.031" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.931" end="00:59:39.131" style="s2">If this disguise is forcibly broken by a</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.031" end="00:59:40.931" style="s2">powerful external force,</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.131" end="00:59:43.831" style="s2">the backlash will instantly destroy your</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.931" end="00:59:45.731" style="s2">vocal cords and leave terrifying magical</p>
<p begin="00:59:43.831" end="00:59:46.231" style="s2">burn scars across that pretty face of</p>
<p begin="00:59:45.731" end="00:59:49.031" style="s2">yours.</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.231" end="00:59:50.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, stop. You will frighten her.</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.031" end="00:59:54.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silence.</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.531" end="00:59:55.831" style="s2">This is a risk she must bear.</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.131" end="00:59:58.331" style="s2">If the backlash goes untreated, you will</p>
<p begin="00:59:55.831" end="01:00:00.731" style="s2">face permanent disfigurement and loss of</p>
<p begin="00:59:58.331" end="01:00:00.731" style="s2">voice.</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.531" end="01:00:04.831" style="s2">Here is a piece of advice. It is still</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.231" end="01:00:06.631" style="s2">not too late to back out.</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.831" end="01:00:08.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am not afraid.</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.631" end="01:00:10.531" style="s2">As long as it helps Darius hold on to</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.231" end="01:00:12.431" style="s2">his position as successor, I am willing</p>
<p begin="01:00:10.531" end="01:00:13.431" style="s2">to endure even the pain of being cut by</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.431" end="01:00:15.731" style="s2">knives.</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.431" end="01:00:17.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very good. The basic rare ingredients</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.731" end="01:00:19.631" style="s2">are all in our family stores,</p>
<p begin="01:00:17.931" end="01:00:21.231" style="s2">but we lack the single most important</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.631" end="01:00:22.331" style="s2">element.</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.231" end="01:00:23.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are we missing?</p>
<p begin="01:00:22.331" end="01:00:24.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For the transformation potion to</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.631" end="01:00:27.331" style="s2">perfectly replicate a person&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.931" end="01:00:29.131" style="s2">appearance and magical aura, it requires</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.331" end="01:00:32.131" style="s2">a trace of that person&#39;s own intimate</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.131" end="01:00:33.731" style="s2">aura as a catalyst. In other words, we</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.131" end="01:00:35.631" style="s2">need Lumera&#39;s blood essence.</p>
<p begin="01:00:33.731" end="01:00:37.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But Lumera detests us now and she has</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.631" end="01:00:40.131" style="s2">the Elf King at her side.</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.831" end="01:00:41.431" style="s2">How are we to obtain her blood essence?</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.131" end="01:00:42.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If only we had obtained some before the</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.431" end="01:00:46.031" style="s2">wedding, where can we find anything</p>
<p begin="01:00:42.731" end="01:00:46.031" style="s2">carrying her blood essence now?</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.331" end="01:00:54.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But this is also the last little thing</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.031" end="01:00:54.331" style="s2">left between Lira and me.</p>
<p begin="01:00:56.931" end="01:01:02.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, does that ring not contain a</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.131" end="01:01:02.931" style="s2">trace of Lumera&#39;s blood essence?</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.131" end="01:01:03.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.931" end="01:01:05.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quickly,</p>
<p begin="01:01:03.931" end="01:01:07.531" style="s2">give me the ring. With this drop of</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.531" end="01:01:09.331" style="s2">blood essence as the catalyst, the</p>
<p begin="01:01:07.531" end="01:01:11.131" style="s2">transformation potion can be brewed to</p>
<p begin="01:01:09.331" end="01:01:12.931" style="s2">perfection at once.</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.131" end="01:01:14.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:01:12.931" end="01:01:16.132" style="s2">Mom, the feral attacks are too</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.631" end="01:01:17.632" style="s2">agonising.</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.132" end="01:01:19.732" style="s2">Without it, what if my feral rage</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.632" end="01:01:21.132" style="s2">spirals completely out of control?</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.732" end="01:01:23.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fool.</p>
<p begin="01:01:21.132" end="01:01:24.532" style="s2">Do you think keeping it now will let you</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.132" end="01:01:26.332" style="s2">rest easy?</p>
<p begin="01:01:24.532" end="01:01:27.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But without it, I may not even survive</p>
<p begin="01:01:26.332" end="01:01:29.032" style="s2">until the next full moon.</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.832" end="01:01:31.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you know how many eyes within the</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.032" end="01:01:33.032" style="s2">clan are watching you now? Elder Silas</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.232" end="01:01:34.332" style="s2">has already lost patience with you, and</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.032" end="01:01:35.732" style="s2">those wastrels of the other branches</p>
<p begin="01:01:34.332" end="01:01:37.132" style="s2">have long been restless, ready at any</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.732" end="01:01:39.432" style="s2">moment to drag you down from the seat of</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.132" end="01:01:40.832" style="s2">succession. Only by winning Lord Astor&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.432" end="01:01:43.532" style="s2">support can you secure the seat of the</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.832" end="01:01:44.932" style="s2">next chieftain. Once you hold power, the</p>
<p begin="01:01:43.532" end="01:01:46.132" style="s2">entire wolf clan will be at your</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.932" end="01:01:47.532" style="s2">command.</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.132" end="01:01:49.032" style="s2">Would you still fear not finding a more</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.532" end="01:01:50.932" style="s2">effective suppressis? Do you want to</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.032" end="01:01:52.932" style="s2">watch your throne be seized by others</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.932" end="01:01:55.732" style="s2">while you become a cowering, tail-waping</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.932" end="01:01:55.732" style="s2">stray dog?</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.132" end="01:02:00.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, Rowena is right. We cannot let</p>
<p begin="01:01:58.532" end="01:02:02.432" style="s2">everything go to waste at this juncture.</p>
<p begin="01:02:00.732" end="01:02:04.232" style="s2">To help you to secure your position,</p>
<p begin="01:02:02.432" end="01:02:05.632" style="s2">even at the risk of the transformation</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.232" end="01:02:07.132" style="s2">potions backlash.</p>
<p begin="01:02:05.632" end="01:02:09.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will do it willingly.</p>
<p begin="01:02:07.132" end="01:02:11.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you not</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.432" end="01:02:12.888" style="s2">Can you not even sacrifice a single ring</p>
<p begin="01:02:11.332" end="01:02:13.432" style="s2">for our future?</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.888" end="01:02:14.832" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.432" end="01:02:16.932" style="s2">Or is it that</p>
<p begin="01:02:14.832" end="01:02:19.232" style="s2">your hesitation is actually because you</p>
<p begin="01:02:16.932" end="01:02:20.632" style="s2">still cannot bear to let go of Lumiria</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.232" end="01:02:22.132" style="s2">in your heart?</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.632" end="01:02:23.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who would be reluctant to let go of a</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.132" end="01:02:24.832" style="s2">woman who has disgraced me so</p>
<p begin="01:02:23.532" end="01:02:26.432" style="s2">thoroughly?</p>
<p begin="01:02:24.832" end="01:02:29.232" style="s2">Mom is right.</p>
<p begin="01:02:26.432" end="01:02:31.232" style="s2">Without power, my life is worthless.</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.232" end="01:02:34.432" style="s2">As long as I can hold the alpha seat, I</p>
<p begin="01:02:31.232" end="01:02:34.432" style="s2">can have whatever I want.</p>
<p begin="01:02:41.332" end="01:02:46.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come now, drink it, and you shall</p>
<p begin="01:02:43.532" end="01:02:47.932" style="s2">possess Lumiria&#39;s aura and appearance.</p>
<p begin="01:02:46.032" end="01:02:49.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If anything goes wrong even slightly,</p>
<p begin="01:02:47.932" end="01:02:50.932" style="s2">everything I schemed so hard to gain</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.532" end="01:02:52.932" style="s2">will vanish into thin air, and I may</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.932" end="01:02:54.732" style="s2">even become a disfigured monster. Am I</p>
<p begin="01:02:52.932" end="01:02:55.732" style="s2">truly going to gamble this much?</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.732" end="01:02:58.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now,</p>
<p begin="01:02:55.732" end="01:03:00.832" style="s2">at this critical moment,</p>
<p begin="01:02:58.532" end="01:03:02.432" style="s2">you begin to get cold feet. Weren&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="01:03:00.832" end="01:03:04.232" style="s2">just now insisting you were willing to</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.432" end="01:03:05.332" style="s2">do anything when you pushed Darius to</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.232" end="01:03:07.032" style="s2">smash the ring?</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.332" end="01:03:09.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="01:03:07.032" end="01:03:11.032" style="s2">I am only afraid of making a mess of it.</p>
<p begin="01:03:09.332" end="01:03:12.632" style="s2">After all, if it goes wrong, I fear it</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.032" end="01:03:13.732" style="s2">will drag Darius into losing his right</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.632" end="01:03:15.532" style="s2">of succession.</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.732" end="01:03:17.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aria,</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.532" end="01:03:19.533" style="s2">do you know how great a sacrifice I made</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.332" end="01:03:22.133" style="s2">just now when I smashed that moonstone?</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.533" end="01:03:24.033" style="s2">I have staked every last chip I have,</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.133" end="01:03:26.033" style="s2">and now you want to back down?</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.033" end="01:03:27.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could I back down?</p>
<p begin="01:03:26.033" end="01:03:29.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you lack even this much courage and</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.933" end="01:03:31.733" style="s2">cannot help me win Lord Astor&#39;s support</p>
<p begin="01:03:29.633" end="01:03:33.133" style="s2">at the banquet,</p>
<p begin="01:03:31.733" end="01:03:34.533" style="s2">then you should never have proposed this</p>
<p begin="01:03:33.133" end="01:03:35.933" style="s2">idea,</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.533" end="01:03:38.333" style="s2">let alone [music] made me destroy the</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.933" end="01:03:40.433" style="s2">only antidote with my own hands.</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.333" end="01:03:41.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our wolf clan has never kept useless</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.433" end="01:03:43.733" style="s2">waste.</p>
<p begin="01:03:41.533" end="01:03:45.433" style="s2">If you do not dare drink this potion,</p>
<p begin="01:03:43.733" end="01:03:47.633" style="s2">clan your things and get out of Moonwood</p>
<p begin="01:03:45.433" end="01:03:49.633" style="s2">Manor this instant. But as long as you</p>
<p begin="01:03:47.633" end="01:03:51.433" style="s2">drink it and help Darius through this</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.633" end="01:03:54.333" style="s2">crisis,</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.433" end="01:03:56.533" style="s2">you will no longer be a lowly human,</p>
<p begin="01:03:54.333" end="01:03:57.733" style="s2">but the future Luna who saved the entire</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.533" end="01:03:59.633" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="01:03:57.733" end="01:04:01.733" style="s2">Think carefully.</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.633" end="01:04:03.333" style="s2">Without our protection, how many days do</p>
<p begin="01:04:01.733" end="01:04:06.233" style="s2">you suppose an ordinary human like you</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.333" end="01:04:06.233" style="s2">could survive out there?</p>
<p begin="01:04:07.133" end="01:04:11.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.833" end="01:04:13.533" style="s2">I absolutely cannot be cast out for</p>
<p begin="01:04:11.333" end="01:04:15.933" style="s2">Darius. For the day I can wear the crown</p>
<p begin="01:04:13.533" end="01:04:18.833" style="s2">of Luna with my head held high, I will</p>
<p begin="01:04:15.933" end="01:04:18.833" style="s2">go all in.</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.433" end="01:04:40.433" style="s2">It hurts so much. My body, it feels like</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.733" end="01:04:42.233" style="s2">it is being cut open by blades. Help.</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.433" end="01:04:43.539" style="s2">Darius.</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.233" end="01:04:44.633" style="s2">Help me.</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.539" end="01:04:46.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.633" end="01:04:48.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you cannot even bear this, how will</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.333" end="01:04:49.933" style="s2">you ever hold the seat of the future</p>
<p begin="01:04:48.033" end="01:04:51.433" style="s2">Luna? Endure the price of this</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.933" end="01:04:52.633" style="s2">transformation well. Once you survive</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.433" end="01:04:56.433" style="s2">it, you will possess the face that</p>
<p begin="01:04:52.633" end="01:04:56.433" style="s2">brings you boundless wealth and glory.</p>
<p begin="01:04:58.604" end="01:05:01.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:04:59.259" end="01:05:01.279" style="s2">[sighs and panting]</p>
<p begin="01:05:01.333" end="01:05:04.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It hurts too much.</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.189" end="01:05:05.633" style="s2">[snorts] Every bone in my body feels as</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.633" end="01:05:07.333" style="s2">though it has been crushed and</p>
<p begin="01:05:05.633" end="01:05:08.733" style="s2">reassembled, and my throat aches with</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.333" end="01:05:10.433" style="s2">every breath.</p>
<p begin="01:05:08.733" end="01:05:11.704" style="s2">Is this the price of forcibly becoming</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.433" end="01:05:13.724" style="s2">Lumaria?</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.704" end="01:05:13.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.733" end="01:05:20.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfection, simply identical. Not just</p>
<p begin="01:05:18.533" end="01:05:22.135" style="s2">the face, but even that irksome aura of</p>
<p begin="01:05:20.333" end="01:05:23.335" style="s2">Lumarias is as indistinguishable. Aria,</p>
<p begin="01:05:22.135" end="01:05:25.535" style="s2">you are now the hope of our entire</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.335" end="01:05:27.335" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.535" end="01:05:28.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This face</p>
<p begin="01:05:27.335" end="01:05:31.135" style="s2">is convincing enough to pass for the</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.635" end="01:05:31.135" style="s2">real thing.</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.535" end="01:05:35.635" style="s2">Aria,</p>
<p begin="01:05:34.235" end="01:05:38.135" style="s2">thank you for being willing to go this</p>
<p begin="01:05:35.635" end="01:05:38.135" style="s2">far for me.</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.635" end="01:05:42.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="01:05:39.835" end="01:05:43.935" style="s2">This is our one and only bargaining chip</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.035" end="01:05:45.835" style="s2">for turning everything around. No one</p>
<p begin="01:05:43.935" end="01:05:48.135" style="s2">will ever see through her disguise.</p>
<p begin="01:05:45.835" end="01:05:50.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have paid such a bitter price. At</p>
<p begin="01:05:48.135" end="01:05:52.735" style="s2">this banquet, we must win Lord Astor&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:05:50.635" end="01:05:54.635" style="s2">support. With his protection, let us see</p>
<p begin="01:05:52.735" end="01:05:57.335" style="s2">who in the clan dares to seize my seat</p>
<p begin="01:05:54.635" end="01:05:57.335" style="s2">of succession.</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.835" end="01:06:01.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have heard that a mysterious Lord</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.335" end="01:06:02.735" style="s2">Astor is to hold a private banquet soon,</p>
<p begin="01:06:01.235" end="01:06:04.535" style="s2">and many factions are stirring because</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.735" end="01:06:06.535" style="s2">of it.</p>
<p begin="01:06:04.535" end="01:06:07.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Indeed.</p>
<p begin="01:06:06.535" end="01:06:10.235" style="s2">After all,</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.935" end="01:06:13.835" style="s2">winning Lord Astor&#39;s favor means gaining</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.235" end="01:06:16.135" style="s2">resources and protection beyond measure.</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.835" end="01:06:17.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I also heard that Darius, in order to</p>
<p begin="01:06:16.135" end="01:06:19.835" style="s2">hold on to his position,</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.935" end="01:06:22.835" style="s2">is sparing no effort to prepare a gift</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.835" end="01:06:22.835" style="s2">for this Lord Astor.</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.935" end="01:06:28.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He has indeed treated this banquet as</p>
<p begin="01:06:25.835" end="01:06:30.535" style="s2">his last lifeline.</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.835" end="01:06:33.335" style="s2">But he probably could never imagine how</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.535" end="01:06:35.535" style="s2">that invitation he treasures so much</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.335" end="01:06:38.235" style="s2">actually ended up in his hands.</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.535" end="01:06:38.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="01:06:39.935" end="01:06:44.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Under the name of Lord Astor, I</p>
<p begin="01:06:41.835" end="01:06:45.335" style="s2">specially sent you an invitation.</p>
<p begin="01:06:44.035" end="01:06:47.735" style="s2">Yet to my surprise, it fell into</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.335" end="01:06:49.535" style="s2">Darius&#39;s hands.</p>
<p begin="01:06:47.735" end="01:06:51.735" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="01:06:49.535" end="01:06:53.235" style="s2">Calith, what did you just say?</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.735" end="01:06:56.535" style="s2">You are actually that commercial titan</p>
<p begin="01:06:53.235" end="01:06:58.135" style="s2">controlling enormous wealth, Lord Astor?</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.535" end="01:07:00.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The world says Lord Astor is</p>
<p begin="01:06:58.135" end="01:07:01.635" style="s2">unfathomable and no one knows his true</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.035" end="01:07:03.535" style="s2">identity.</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.635" end="01:07:06.335" style="s2">The Wolf clan owes its prosperity to his</p>
<p begin="01:07:03.535" end="01:07:06.335" style="s2">past favor.</p>
<p begin="01:07:06.435" end="01:07:09.035" style="s2">To think this great figure is actually</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.035" end="01:07:12.435" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:07:09.035" end="01:07:15.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rumors inevitably exaggerate.</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.435" end="01:07:17.335" style="s2">I did all this merely on a whim.</p>
<p begin="01:07:15.635" end="01:07:18.835" style="s2">With the invitation in hand,</p>
<p begin="01:07:17.335" end="01:07:20.335" style="s2">Darius will surely attend in full</p>
<p begin="01:07:18.835" end="01:07:23.535" style="s2">finery. Would you like to go to the</p>
<p begin="01:07:20.335" end="01:07:25.036" style="s2">banquet in in to watch this farce?</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.535" end="01:07:28.736" style="s2">I imagine the look on their faces when</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.036" end="01:07:30.536" style="s2">they see you will be quite entertaining.</p>
<p begin="01:07:28.736" end="01:07:32.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The ridiculous struggles Darius has made</p>
<p begin="01:07:30.536" end="01:07:34.936" style="s2">to climb up mean no more to me now than</p>
<p begin="01:07:32.336" end="01:07:34.936" style="s2">a farce.</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.136" end="01:07:39.236" style="s2">Darius no longer has anything to do with</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.936" end="01:07:40.836" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:07:39.236" end="01:07:42.936" style="s2">I do not wish to waste my time on such a</p>
<p begin="01:07:40.836" end="01:07:46.036" style="s2">person, so naturally I have no intention</p>
<p begin="01:07:42.936" end="01:07:46.036" style="s2">of attending this banquet.</p>
<p begin="01:07:46.236" end="01:07:51.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But my invitation was addressed to you</p>
<p begin="01:07:48.736" end="01:07:51.736" style="s2">and your fiance.</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.436" end="01:07:55.836" style="s2">I truly do not know even if Darius gets</p>
<p begin="01:07:54.336" end="01:07:59.536" style="s2">his hands on the invitation in what</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.836" end="01:08:03.136" style="s2">capacity he plans to appear. After all,</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.536" end="01:08:03.136" style="s2">I am now your lawful husband.</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.636" end="01:08:09.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since he is so eager to curt favor with</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.536" end="01:08:12.036" style="s2">Lord Astor, even sparing no cost to</p>
<p begin="01:08:09.236" end="01:08:13.736" style="s2">prepare a gift,</p>
<p begin="01:08:12.036" end="01:08:16.636" style="s2">why not go to the banquet together for a</p>
<p begin="01:08:13.736" end="01:08:16.636" style="s2">bit of amusement?</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.236" end="01:08:20.536" style="s2">This is the stage on which he has pinned</p>
<p begin="01:08:18.836" end="01:08:23.336" style="s2">all his hopes.</p>
<p begin="01:08:20.536" end="01:08:26.836" style="s2">If he discover the leading lady is you,</p>
<p begin="01:08:23.336" end="01:08:26.836" style="s2">it will surely be quite delightful.</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.136" end="01:08:29.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Calath is right.</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.136" end="01:08:34.536" style="s2">Lumiria, Darius humiliated you so at the</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.836" end="01:08:36.936" style="s2">wedding and then brought that IRA here</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.536" end="01:08:40.436" style="s2">again and again to pester us.</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.936" end="01:08:40.436" style="s2">We must not let them off so easily.</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.736" end="01:08:43.336" style="s2">Besides,</p>
<p begin="01:08:42.236" end="01:08:45.136" style="s2">ever since you withdrawn your</p>
<p begin="01:08:43.336" end="01:08:47.336" style="s2">privileges, those Wolf Clan people have</p>
<p begin="01:08:45.136" end="01:08:48.736" style="s2">been harassing us constantly, repeatedly</p>
<p begin="01:08:47.336" end="01:08:50.336" style="s2">trying to renegotiate the suppressant</p>
<p begin="01:08:48.736" end="01:08:53.036" style="s2">supply.</p>
<p begin="01:08:50.336" end="01:08:53.036" style="s2">How shameless.</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.736" end="01:08:57.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, my darling.</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.836" end="01:08:59.136" style="s2">You cannot always choose to back down</p>
<p begin="01:08:57.436" end="01:09:00.736" style="s2">and ignore them. That will only make the</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.136" end="01:09:01.836" style="s2">Wolf Clan think our Sinclair family is</p>
<p begin="01:09:00.736" end="01:09:03.536" style="s2">easy to bully.</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.836" end="01:09:05.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want them to see clearly that without</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.536" end="01:09:07.536" style="s2">our family support Darius is nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:09:05.736" end="01:09:09.536" style="s2">This banquet Calath is hosting is the</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.536" end="01:09:11.736" style="s2">perfect chance to make them face reality</p>
<p begin="01:09:09.536" end="01:09:13.936" style="s2">once and for all.</p>
<p begin="01:09:11.736" end="01:09:17.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You must thoroughly cut off Darius&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.936" end="01:09:17.136" style="s2">unrealistic hopes.</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.236" end="01:09:21.236" style="s2">Hearing you all put it that way, if I do</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.836" end="01:09:22.536" style="s2">not go, it would be a shame to waste the</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.236" end="01:09:25.436" style="s2">grand show they have gone to such</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.536" end="01:09:25.436" style="s2">trouble to prepare.</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.737" end="01:09:31.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very well.</p>
<p begin="01:09:30.038" end="01:09:33.838" style="s2">Let us go together and see just what</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.737" end="01:09:36.038" style="s2">kind of surprise Darius has in store for</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.838" end="01:09:36.038" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="01:09:36.338" end="01:09:39.938" style="s2">Rowena actually forbade me from stepping</p>
<p begin="01:09:38.237" end="01:09:42.038" style="s2">outside the manor on the pretext of</p>
<p begin="01:09:39.938" end="01:09:45.637" style="s2">fearing I might be exposed.</p>
<p begin="01:09:42.038" end="01:09:47.938" style="s2">She has me locked up like a prisoner.</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.637" end="01:09:49.938" style="s2">I am enduring so much pain. Even if the</p>
<p begin="01:09:47.938" end="01:09:52.338" style="s2">banquet plan fails, I absolutely cannot</p>
<p begin="01:09:49.938" end="01:09:54.038" style="s2">lose Darius. As long as I can fully win</p>
<p begin="01:09:52.338" end="01:09:56.338" style="s2">Darius over tonight and secure my</p>
<p begin="01:09:54.038" end="01:09:59.338" style="s2">position, what does it matter even if I</p>
<p begin="01:09:56.338" end="01:09:59.338" style="s2">have become like this?</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.238" end="01:10:06.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GET OUT!</p>
<p begin="01:10:03.538" end="01:10:08.438" style="s2">I SAID I WILL SEE NO ONE!</p>
<p begin="01:10:06.038" end="01:10:10.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LUMINA?</p>
<p begin="01:10:08.438" end="01:10:13.137" style="s2">WHY are you here?</p>
<p begin="01:10:10.838" end="01:10:14.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, it is me.</p>
<p begin="01:10:13.137" end="01:10:18.137" style="s2">I heard things have been very bad for</p>
<p begin="01:10:14.637" end="01:10:22.137" style="s2">you lately and I was worried about you.</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.137" end="01:10:22.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did things come to such a past?</p>
<p begin="01:10:24.143" end="01:10:26.163" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:10:26.738" end="01:10:30.938" style="s2">After last night, I have truly burned</p>
<p begin="01:10:28.637" end="01:10:32.438" style="s2">all my bridges.</p>
<p begin="01:10:30.938" end="01:10:36.438" style="s2">I no longer have the right nor any</p>
<p begin="01:10:32.438" end="01:10:38.238" style="s2">possibility of going back to Lumiera.</p>
<p begin="01:10:36.438" end="01:10:40.338" style="s2">But Aria endured the potion&#39;s backlash</p>
<p begin="01:10:38.238" end="01:10:42.938" style="s2">for my sake and suffered pain like skin</p>
<p begin="01:10:40.338" end="01:10:45.637" style="s2">being peeled and bone scraped.</p>
<p begin="01:10:42.938" end="01:10:47.338" style="s2">I can no longer be indecisive.</p>
<p begin="01:10:45.637" end="01:10:49.637" style="s2">I must win his support at Lord Astor&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.338" end="01:10:52.338" style="s2">banquet or I will have failed everyone&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:10:49.637" end="01:10:52.338" style="s2">sacrifice.</p>
<p begin="01:10:55.938" end="01:11:01.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius?</p>
<p begin="01:10:58.238" end="01:11:03.938" style="s2">Are you blaming me?</p>
<p begin="01:11:01.038" end="01:11:03.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not overthink.</p>
<p begin="01:11:04.838" end="01:11:07.738" style="s2">How could I blame you?</p>
<p begin="01:11:08.838" end="01:11:13.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.338" end="01:11:15.889" style="s2">I should not at a time like this,</p>
<p begin="01:11:13.238" end="01:11:17.637" style="s2">but I truly love you too much.</p>
<p begin="01:11:15.889" end="01:11:20.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:11:17.637" end="01:11:23.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not let your mind run wild.</p>
<p begin="01:11:20.538" end="01:11:26.637" style="s2">You have endured so much for me.</p>
<p begin="01:11:23.038" end="01:11:26.637" style="s2">I could not bear to see you suffer more.</p>
<p begin="01:11:26.738" end="01:11:30.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, I want to go out.</p>
<p begin="01:11:29.739" end="01:11:32.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rowena is thinking of the bigger</p>
<p begin="01:11:30.939" end="01:11:34.039" style="s2">picture.</p>
<p begin="01:11:32.439" end="01:11:35.539" style="s2">You are wearing Lumiria&#39;s face now. If</p>
<p begin="01:11:34.039" end="01:11:38.539" style="s2">anyone discovers you, our plan will be</p>
<p begin="01:11:35.539" end="01:11:38.539" style="s2">completely ruined.</p>
<p begin="01:11:41.339" end="01:11:44.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, Darius.</p>
<p begin="01:11:45.539" end="01:11:49.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, go if you want to.</p>
<p begin="01:11:47.739" end="01:11:51.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Darius.</p>
<p begin="01:11:49.739" end="01:11:52.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you must never let anyone see your</p>
<p begin="01:11:51.139" end="01:11:54.039" style="s2">current face, and above all, you must</p>
<p begin="01:11:52.839" end="01:11:56.939" style="s2">not reveal that you use the</p>
<p begin="01:11:54.039" end="01:11:56.939" style="s2">transformation potion.</p>
<p begin="01:12:03.439" end="01:12:06.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, these are all limited editions of</p>
<p begin="01:12:05.239" end="01:12:07.539" style="s2">our shop.</p>
<p begin="01:12:06.439" end="01:12:10.339" style="s2">Would you not like to try them on for</p>
<p begin="01:12:07.539" end="01:12:10.339" style="s2">size first?</p>
<p begin="01:12:12.239" end="01:12:15.739" style="s2">Charge the card.</p>
<p begin="01:12:13.739" end="01:12:18.339" style="s2">Yes, yes, right away. I shall take care</p>
<p begin="01:12:15.739" end="01:12:18.339" style="s2">of it for you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:30.939" end="01:12:33.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The owner of this shop is an old</p>
<p begin="01:12:32.039" end="01:12:34.739" style="s2">acquaintance of mine, and his</p>
<p begin="01:12:33.039" end="01:12:36.339" style="s2">craftsmanship is decent.</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.739" end="01:12:38.439" style="s2">He has had some free time lately, so I</p>
<p begin="01:12:36.339" end="01:12:40.539" style="s2">asked him to design a gown for you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:38.439" end="01:12:43.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You arrange it however you like. I trust</p>
<p begin="01:12:40.539" end="01:12:43.039" style="s2">your taste.</p>
<p begin="01:13:01.939" end="01:13:05.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Calath, you are finally here.</p>
<p begin="01:13:04.239" end="01:13:08.639" style="s2">I have prepared the fabrics and the</p>
<p begin="01:13:05.639" end="01:13:11.739" style="s2">design sketches you asked for.</p>
<p begin="01:13:08.639" end="01:13:11.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for the trouble, Elian.</p>
<p begin="01:13:14.239" end="01:13:20.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So this is Lumiria.</p>
<p begin="01:13:17.239" end="01:13:20.939" style="s2">Truly, you exceed your reputation.</p>
<p begin="01:13:20.039" end="01:13:22.439" style="s2">Come.</p>
<p begin="01:13:20.939" end="01:13:23.839" style="s2">The VIP room on the second floor is</p>
<p begin="01:13:22.439" end="01:13:25.739" style="s2">ready.</p>
<p begin="01:13:23.839" end="01:13:28.739" style="s2">Let us go up and talk at leisure and see</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.739" end="01:13:32.140" style="s2">whether it suits your taste.</p>
<p begin="01:13:28.739" end="01:13:33.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very well. Sorry to trouble</p>
<p begin="01:13:32.140" end="01:13:35.540" style="s2">Good heavens. The owner has not</p>
<p begin="01:13:33.740" end="01:13:37.140" style="s2">personally taken on a client in years.</p>
<p begin="01:13:35.540" end="01:13:38.940" style="s2">He even turns down vampire princes</p>
<p begin="01:13:37.140" end="01:13:40.340" style="s2">without a second thought.</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.940" end="01:13:41.955" style="s2">Who are these two that the owner would</p>
<p begin="01:13:40.340" end="01:13:43.440" style="s2">make an exception?</p>
<p begin="01:13:41.955" end="01:13:46.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.440" end="01:13:46.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank goodness we were not discovered.</p>
<p begin="01:13:49.840" end="01:13:53.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumaria,</p>
<p begin="01:13:51.340" end="01:13:54.540" style="s2">why must you always stand a step above</p>
<p begin="01:13:53.440" end="01:13:57.240" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="01:13:54.540" end="01:13:58.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She once had eyes only for me.</p>
<p begin="01:13:57.240" end="01:13:59.640" style="s2">Yet now there is someone else by her</p>
<p begin="01:13:58.940" end="01:14:02.340" style="s2">side.</p>
<p begin="01:13:59.640" end="01:14:06.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumaria, I hate you.</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.340" end="01:14:06.140" style="s2">If only I had killed you back then.</p>
<p begin="01:14:08.811" end="01:14:11.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:14:10.121" end="01:14:12.840" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.040" end="01:14:17.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you standing there for?</p>
<p begin="01:14:12.840" end="01:14:17.240" style="s2">Before they notice us, let us go. Now.</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.740" end="01:14:27.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumaria,</p>
<p begin="01:14:25.040" end="01:14:28.740" style="s2">once I have won Lord Astor&#39;s support, I</p>
<p begin="01:14:27.340" end="01:14:30.340" style="s2">will make you feel my pain a</p>
<p begin="01:14:28.740" end="01:14:32.240" style="s2">hundredfold,</p>
<p begin="01:14:30.340" end="01:14:34.740" style="s2">a thousandfold.</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.240" end="01:14:36.440" style="s2">What use is this face alone?</p>
<p begin="01:14:34.740" end="01:14:38.940" style="s2">Lumaria is the eldest daughter of the</p>
<p begin="01:14:36.440" end="01:14:42.040" style="s2">Sinclair family. Your shabby appearance</p>
<p begin="01:14:38.940" end="01:14:44.440" style="s2">now does not even resemble half of her.</p>
<p begin="01:14:42.040" end="01:14:47.140" style="s2">If Lord Astor sees through you, not only</p>
<p begin="01:14:44.440" end="01:14:49.740" style="s2">will Darius&#39;s seat as successor be lost,</p>
<p begin="01:14:47.140" end="01:14:52.140" style="s2">but you will die too.</p>
<p begin="01:14:49.740" end="01:14:54.661" style="s2">I can learn.</p>
<p begin="01:14:52.140" end="01:14:55.540" style="s2">I will perfectly take her place.</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.661" end="01:14:59.340" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:14:55.540" end="01:14:59.340" style="s2">Lord Astor, it is an honor</p>
<p begin="01:15:01.866" end="01:15:03.886" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:15:06.040" end="01:15:08.940" style="s2">It hurts</p>
<p begin="01:15:07.640" end="01:15:11.340" style="s2">my throat.</p>
<p begin="01:15:08.940" end="01:15:13.940" style="s2">Endure the pain.</p>
<p begin="01:15:11.340" end="01:15:13.940" style="s2">Continue.</p>
<p begin="01:15:16.240" end="01:15:20.140" style="s2">Lord Astor, it is an honor to attend</p>
<p begin="01:15:18.140" end="01:15:21.840" style="s2">your banquet. When Lumaria speaks to</p>
<p begin="01:15:20.140" end="01:15:24.136" style="s2">people, she never casts her eyes down</p>
<p begin="01:15:21.840" end="01:15:25.940" style="s2">the way you do. Wit.</p>
<p begin="01:15:24.136" end="01:15:28.340" style="s2">[gasps and sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:15:25.940" end="01:15:28.340" style="s2">Again.</p>
<p begin="01:15:30.340" end="01:15:35.242" style="s2">Lord Astor, it is an honor attend your</p>
<p begin="01:15:32.742" end="01:15:35.242" style="s2">banquet.</p>
<p begin="01:15:36.242" end="01:15:40.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very good.</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.942" end="01:15:43.442" style="s2">Remember this feeling. There must not be</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.042" end="01:15:43.442" style="s2">the slightest flaw.</p>
<p begin="01:15:45.842" end="01:15:49.742" style="s2">The time of the banquet has finally</p>
<p begin="01:15:47.642" end="01:15:53.742" style="s2">come. Come.</p>
<p begin="01:15:49.742" end="01:15:53.742" style="s2">Tonight we must win Lord Astor over.</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.642" end="01:16:01.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It seems she has not come. As long as we</p>
<p begin="01:15:59.342" end="01:16:03.942" style="s2">secure his support tonight, even if she</p>
<p begin="01:16:01.642" end="01:16:05.942" style="s2">learns of it later, it will be too late.</p>
<p begin="01:16:03.942" end="01:16:08.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not worry. I will never let anyone</p>
<p begin="01:16:05.942" end="01:16:08.942" style="s2">see through the disguise.</p>
<p begin="01:16:11.042" end="01:16:16.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that not Lumiria?</p>
<p begin="01:16:13.342" end="01:16:16.442" style="s2">Why has she come with Darius?</p>
<p begin="01:16:16.642" end="01:16:20.142" style="s2">Those two fell out so badly at the</p>
<p begin="01:16:18.542" end="01:16:22.542" style="s2">wedding that they never even exchanged</p>
<p begin="01:16:20.142" end="01:16:25.642" style="s2">marks. And Lumiria even proposed to the</p>
<p begin="01:16:22.542" end="01:16:25.642" style="s2">Elf King in public.</p>
<p begin="01:16:26.342" end="01:16:29.742" style="s2">How are they mixed up together again?</p>
<p begin="01:16:30.342" end="01:16:33.942" style="s2">Could Darius have won Lumiria&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:16:31.642" end="01:16:35.642" style="s2">forgiveness?</p>
<p begin="01:16:33.942" end="01:16:36.842" style="s2">The Elf King was merely indulging a</p>
<p begin="01:16:35.642" end="01:16:39.942" style="s2">whim.</p>
<p begin="01:16:36.842" end="01:16:42.042" style="s2">How could he truly marry her?</p>
<p begin="01:16:39.942" end="01:16:44.542" style="s2">In the end, she cannot let go of Darius,</p>
<p begin="01:16:42.042" end="01:16:46.542" style="s2">the Wolf Clan&#39;s future heir.</p>
<p begin="01:16:44.542" end="01:16:48.142" style="s2">And so here she is, [music] meekly</p>
<p begin="01:16:46.542" end="01:16:50.642" style="s2">accompanying him to Lord Astor&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.142" end="01:16:50.642" style="s2">banquet.</p>
<p begin="01:16:54.142" end="01:16:56.542" style="s2">Arya,</p>
<p begin="01:16:55.542" end="01:16:57.942" style="s2">thank you for being willing to go this</p>
<p begin="01:16:56.542" end="01:16:59.542" style="s2">far for me.</p>
<p begin="01:16:57.942" end="01:17:01.242" style="s2">I swear, once I have secured my seat as</p>
<p begin="01:16:59.542" end="01:17:02.742" style="s2">successor, I will make you my rightful</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.242" end="01:17:04.542" style="s2">wife in grand style so that you never</p>
<p begin="01:17:02.742" end="01:17:07.642" style="s2">have to suffer this humiliation again.</p>
<p begin="01:17:04.542" end="01:17:07.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For you, this is nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:17:19.742" end="01:17:23.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Heavens.</p>
<p begin="01:17:21.942" end="01:17:24.942" style="s2">How</p>
<p begin="01:17:23.042" end="01:17:26.442" style="s2">How can there be two Lumirias?</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.942" end="01:17:28.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good gracious, what on earth is going</p>
<p begin="01:17:26.442" end="01:17:28.842" style="s2">on?</p>
<p begin="01:17:44.243" end="01:17:46.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn it.</p>
<p begin="01:17:47.043" end="01:17:49.743" style="s2">Why is she here?</p>
<p begin="01:17:53.643" end="01:17:58.719" style="s2">Hurry.</p>
<p begin="01:17:55.543" end="01:18:00.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave. We must leave this place at once.</p>
<p begin="01:17:58.719" end="01:18:00.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:18:07.843" end="01:18:12.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, leaving in such a hurry.</p>
<p begin="01:18:10.943" end="01:18:15.094" style="s2">Have you done something shameful that</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.543" end="01:18:15.743" style="s2">you fear being exposed in public?</p>
<p begin="01:18:15.094" end="01:18:19.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:18:15.743" end="01:18:19.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria, do not put on airs here.</p>
<p begin="01:18:21.543" end="01:18:24.943" style="s2">Why should I feel guilty before you?</p>
<p begin="01:18:31.143" end="01:18:35.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that so?</p>
<p begin="01:18:33.643" end="01:18:38.943" style="s2">Then should this person beside you not</p>
<p begin="01:18:35.243" end="01:18:38.943" style="s2">give me a reasonable explanation?</p>
<p begin="01:18:40.843" end="01:18:44.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have no need to explain anything to</p>
<p begin="01:18:42.543" end="01:18:45.843" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.143" end="01:18:47.543" style="s2">I can stand here because I received a</p>
<p begin="01:18:45.843" end="01:18:50.443" style="s2">personal invitation from the host of</p>
<p begin="01:18:47.543" end="01:18:52.843" style="s2">this banquet, Lord Astor.</p>
<p begin="01:18:50.443" end="01:18:54.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lord Astor is a figure of immense reach</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.843" end="01:18:56.743" style="s2">and power.</p>
<p begin="01:18:54.743" end="01:18:58.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even you.</p>
<p begin="01:18:56.743" end="01:19:01.043" style="s2">What right do you have to shout at me</p>
<p begin="01:18:58.643" end="01:19:01.043" style="s2">here?</p>
<p begin="01:19:02.643" end="01:19:04.843" style="s2">Oh.</p>
<p begin="01:19:06.143" end="01:19:10.743" style="s2">I do not seem to recall inviting a fool</p>
<p begin="01:19:08.243" end="01:19:10.743" style="s2">like you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:14.243" end="01:19:19.243" style="s2">My invitation stated quite clearly that</p>
<p begin="01:19:16.343" end="01:19:21.543" style="s2">I invited Lumeria and her fiance.</p>
<p begin="01:19:19.243" end="01:19:21.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:19:21.943" end="01:19:25.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are Lord Astor.</p>
<p begin="01:19:25.943" end="01:19:31.143" style="s2">I invited Lumeria&#39;s fiance.</p>
<p begin="01:19:28.243" end="01:19:31.143" style="s2">What are you supposed to be?</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.005" end="01:19:37.025" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:19:38.043" end="01:19:41.945" style="s2">So So is it.</p>
<p begin="01:19:39.844" end="01:19:43.644" style="s2">Bringing an imposter to swindle at Lord</p>
<p begin="01:19:41.945" end="01:19:46.045" style="s2">Astor&#39;s banquet, he has utterly</p>
<p begin="01:19:43.644" end="01:19:47.344" style="s2">disgraced the wolf clan.</p>
<p begin="01:19:46.045" end="01:19:49.244" style="s2">Now that he has been caught by the real</p>
<p begin="01:19:47.344" end="01:19:53.344" style="s2">person and the elf king,</p>
<p begin="01:19:49.244" end="01:19:53.344" style="s2">I reckon this future alpha is finished.</p>
<p begin="01:19:59.895" end="01:20:03.744" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.244" end="01:20:06.945" style="s2">Lumaria,</p>
<p begin="01:20:03.744" end="01:20:06.945" style="s2">you were right. I am a fool.</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.244" end="01:20:11.545" style="s2">I thought that as long as I won Lord</p>
<p begin="01:20:09.744" end="01:20:12.945" style="s2">Astor&#39;s support, I could prove to</p>
<p begin="01:20:11.545" end="01:20:14.744" style="s2">everyone that I could hold the seat of</p>
<p begin="01:20:12.945" end="01:20:17.045" style="s2">succession even without you. How</p>
<p begin="01:20:14.744" end="01:20:21.045" style="s2">laughable that I schemed so hard only to</p>
<p begin="01:20:17.045" end="01:20:21.045" style="s2">lose even my last shred of dignity.</p>
<p begin="01:20:21.545" end="01:20:26.644" style="s2">I know I have nothing left now and you</p>
<p begin="01:20:25.144" end="01:20:26.744" style="s2">you have already drifted far from me,</p>
<p begin="01:20:26.644" end="01:20:28.344" style="s2">but</p>
<p begin="01:20:26.744" end="01:20:31.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have no interest in listening to your</p>
<p begin="01:20:28.344" end="01:20:31.344" style="s2">absurd drivel.</p>
<p begin="01:20:33.955" end="01:20:37.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="01:20:34.945" end="01:20:39.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good heavens.</p>
<p begin="01:20:37.144" end="01:20:41.844" style="s2">To use such a forbidden potion for a</p>
<p begin="01:20:39.045" end="01:20:44.644" style="s2">disguise and suffer backlash like this,</p>
<p begin="01:20:41.844" end="01:20:44.644" style="s2">she deserves it.</p>
<p begin="01:20:49.144" end="01:20:51.445" style="s2">Aria?</p>
<p begin="01:20:54.744" end="01:20:58.244" style="s2">Lumaria, all the wrongs are mine, every</p>
<p begin="01:20:56.545" end="01:21:00.244" style="s2">one of them, but Aria is still my fated</p>
<p begin="01:20:58.244" end="01:21:03.644" style="s2">mate after all.</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.244" end="01:21:03.644" style="s2">I beg you, can you please let her go?</p>
<p begin="01:21:04.244" end="01:21:09.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius,</p>
<p begin="01:21:05.844" end="01:21:09.445" style="s2">have you still not seen her true colors?</p>
<p begin="01:21:12.644" end="01:21:16.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="01:21:14.744" end="01:21:17.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She not only falsely claimed the credit</p>
<p begin="01:21:16.144" end="01:21:19.344" style="s2">for saving your life,</p>
<p begin="01:21:17.945" end="01:21:21.744" style="s2">she also pretended to be your fated</p>
<p begin="01:21:19.344" end="01:21:21.744" style="s2">mate.</p>
<p begin="01:21:22.545" end="01:21:26.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumaria, what on earth are you talking</p>
<p begin="01:21:24.445" end="01:21:29.545" style="s2">about? Was it not Aria who risked</p>
<p begin="01:21:26.445" end="01:21:30.945" style="s2">everything to save me back then?</p>
<p begin="01:21:29.545" end="01:21:33.244" style="s2">Aria, tell me.</p>
<p begin="01:21:30.945" end="01:21:35.344" style="s2">She is lying, is she not? It was you who</p>
<p begin="01:21:33.244" end="01:21:38.244" style="s2">saved me back then. It was always you.</p>
<p begin="01:21:35.344" end="01:21:38.244" style="s2">Tell her quickly.</p>
<p begin="01:21:38.801" end="01:21:40.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:21:41.545" end="01:21:45.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What What going on?</p>
<p begin="01:21:43.146" end="01:21:46.345" style="s2">Is the savior of the wolf clan&#39;s future</p>
<p begin="01:21:45.245" end="01:21:47.946" style="s2">alpha</p>
<p begin="01:21:46.345" end="01:21:49.745" style="s2">not this human?</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.946" end="01:21:51.546" style="s2">Use your head for once.</p>
<p begin="01:21:49.745" end="01:21:53.946" style="s2">A werewolf with a fatal wound, how could</p>
<p begin="01:21:51.546" end="01:21:55.646" style="s2">a human with no magic possibly save him?</p>
<p begin="01:21:53.946" end="01:21:56.546" style="s2">Only a fool like Darius would believe it</p>
<p begin="01:21:55.646" end="01:21:58.046" style="s2">so thoroughly.</p>
<p begin="01:21:56.546" end="01:21:59.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius,</p>
<p begin="01:21:58.046" end="01:22:01.245" style="s2">back then your heart was damaged and</p>
<p begin="01:21:59.745" end="01:22:02.646" style="s2">your wound was drenched in deadly</p>
<p begin="01:22:01.245" end="01:22:04.345" style="s2">poison.</p>
<p begin="01:22:02.646" end="01:22:06.245" style="s2">What could an ordinary human like her</p>
<p begin="01:22:04.345" end="01:22:07.946" style="s2">possibly have used to save you?</p>
<p begin="01:22:06.245" end="01:22:09.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:22:07.946" end="01:22:11.245" style="s2">That is not true. When I woke up back</p>
<p begin="01:22:09.646" end="01:22:12.845" style="s2">then it was she who stayed by my side</p>
<p begin="01:22:11.245" end="01:22:14.146" style="s2">and cared for me. If you say you were</p>
<p begin="01:22:12.845" end="01:22:14.745" style="s2">the one who saved me, then where were</p>
<p begin="01:22:14.146" end="01:22:16.845" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="01:22:14.745" end="01:22:18.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where was I? I used my blood essence to</p>
<p begin="01:22:16.845" end="01:22:20.345" style="s2">rebuild your heart&#39;s vessels and purge</p>
<p begin="01:22:18.646" end="01:22:23.146" style="s2">the poisoned blood and I collapsed</p>
<p begin="01:22:20.345" end="01:22:25.345" style="s2">unconscious right beside you. And she</p>
<p begin="01:22:23.146" end="01:22:27.146" style="s2">she is nothing but a took advantage.</p>
<p begin="01:22:25.345" end="01:22:28.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What proof do you have? Lumiria, are you</p>
<p begin="01:22:27.146" end="01:22:31.046" style="s2">making up these lies to torment me out</p>
<p begin="01:22:28.845" end="01:22:33.146" style="s2">of revenge?</p>
<p begin="01:22:31.046" end="01:22:34.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, watch your tone. If Lumiria</p>
<p begin="01:22:33.146" end="01:22:37.146" style="s2">wanted to torment you, she would need no</p>
<p begin="01:22:34.546" end="01:22:37.146" style="s2">excuse.</p>
<p begin="01:22:38.345" end="01:22:41.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Proof?</p>
<p begin="01:22:39.345" end="01:22:44.245" style="s2">Very well.</p>
<p begin="01:22:41.245" end="01:22:44.245" style="s2">I shall give it to you.</p>
<p begin="01:22:46.646" end="01:22:50.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Inside my body,</p>
<p begin="01:22:49.446" end="01:22:52.646" style="s2">how can there be your mark?</p>
<p begin="01:22:50.946" end="01:22:53.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since Arya keeps insisting that she</p>
<p begin="01:22:52.646" end="01:22:55.946" style="s2">saved you,</p>
<p begin="01:22:53.845" end="01:22:58.446" style="s2">why not ask her? Can she make this mark</p>
<p begin="01:22:55.946" end="01:22:58.446" style="s2">resonate?</p>
<p begin="01:23:04.745" end="01:23:09.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So all of this was fake? Arya, why did</p>
<p begin="01:23:07.745" end="01:23:10.946" style="s2">you deceive me?</p>
<p begin="01:23:09.847" end="01:23:13.946" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:23:10.946" end="01:23:15.845" style="s2">Not only was the life-saving debt false,</p>
<p begin="01:23:13.946" end="01:23:17.345" style="s2">even that fated mate bond you took such</p>
<p begin="01:23:15.845" end="01:23:19.672" style="s2">pride in was nothing but a carefully</p>
<p begin="01:23:17.345" end="01:23:20.245" style="s2">fabricated joke.</p>
<p begin="01:23:19.672" end="01:23:22.046" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:23:20.245" end="01:23:23.946" style="s2">What do you mean? She secretly obtained</p>
<p begin="01:23:22.046" end="01:23:25.546" style="s2">a kind of fated mate potion made</p>
<p begin="01:23:23.946" end="01:23:27.646" style="s2">specifically to deceive brainless</p>
<p begin="01:23:25.546" end="01:23:29.046" style="s2">werewolves like you. With long-term use,</p>
<p begin="01:23:27.646" end="01:23:32.146" style="s2">anyone can present themselves as a</p>
<p begin="01:23:29.046" end="01:23:32.146" style="s2">werewolf&#39;s fated mate.</p>
<p begin="01:23:34.345" end="01:23:38.745" style="s2">The feeling of soul resonance has</p>
<p begin="01:23:35.845" end="01:23:40.646" style="s2">completely vanished.</p>
<p begin="01:23:38.745" end="01:23:43.345" style="s2">You are not my fated mate at all. How</p>
<p begin="01:23:40.646" end="01:23:45.847" style="s2">ridiculous. The mighty future alpha of</p>
<p begin="01:23:43.345" end="01:23:48.347" style="s2">the wolf class led around by the nose by</p>
<p begin="01:23:45.847" end="01:23:50.247" style="s2">a magicless, lying human, and he even</p>
<p begin="01:23:48.347" end="01:23:52.447" style="s2">abandoned his true fiancee for such</p>
<p begin="01:23:50.247" end="01:23:55.947" style="s2">trash.</p>
<p begin="01:23:52.447" end="01:23:57.947" style="s2">A complete and utter blind fool.</p>
<p begin="01:23:55.947" end="01:23:59.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius,</p>
<p begin="01:23:57.947" end="01:24:01.147" style="s2">why do you think your feral rage has</p>
<p begin="01:23:59.447" end="01:24:03.947" style="s2">been worsening? Why even the best</p>
<p begin="01:24:01.147" end="01:24:05.347" style="s2">suppressors no longer work?</p>
<p begin="01:24:03.947" end="01:24:07.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you trying to say?</p>
<p begin="01:24:05.347" end="01:24:09.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because to sustain this monstrous lie,</p>
<p begin="01:24:07.847" end="01:24:11.547" style="s2">she had to brew that forbidden potion</p>
<p begin="01:24:09.647" end="01:24:13.547" style="s2">with your blood. You were feeding a</p>
<p begin="01:24:11.547" end="01:24:15.348" style="s2">blood-sucking swindler with your own</p>
<p begin="01:24:13.547" end="01:24:15.947" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="01:24:15.348" end="01:24:17.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:24:15.947" end="01:24:20.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You,</p>
<p begin="01:24:17.747" end="01:24:22.947" style="s2">you, I was so good to you. WHY WOULD YOU</p>
<p begin="01:24:20.247" end="01:24:22.947" style="s2">DO THIS?</p>
<p begin="01:24:23.208" end="01:24:25.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:24:25.547" end="01:24:30.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You do not deserve my love.</p>
<p begin="01:24:28.547" end="01:24:33.033" style="s2">Return what belongs to me</p>
<p begin="01:24:30.747" end="01:24:35.053" style="s2">WITH INTEREST.</p>
<p begin="01:24:33.033" end="01:24:35.053" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:24:35.947" end="01:24:40.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO.</p>
<p begin="01:24:37.147" end="01:24:40.747" style="s2">LUMERIA, I BEG YOU DO NOT DO THIS.</p>
<p begin="01:24:42.203" end="01:24:44.223" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:24:50.718" end="01:24:52.147" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:24:51.373" end="01:24:54.147" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:24:52.147" end="01:24:56.614" style="s2">LOSING YOUR MIND ON MY TURF, WHO GAVE</p>
<p begin="01:24:54.147" end="01:24:57.247" style="s2">YOU THE RERVE?</p>
<p begin="01:24:56.614" end="01:25:00.247" style="s2">[panting and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:24:57.247" end="01:25:02.509" style="s2">How did it come to this?</p>
<p begin="01:25:00.247" end="01:25:04.529" style="s2">What on earth have I done?</p>
<p begin="01:25:02.509" end="01:25:04.529" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:25:06.747" end="01:25:11.047" style="s2">Lumeria,</p>
<p begin="01:25:08.047" end="01:25:13.147" style="s2">I am sorry. I was wrong. I truly know I</p>
<p begin="01:25:11.047" end="01:25:15.047" style="s2">was wrong. It was my blindness and my</p>
<p begin="01:25:13.147" end="01:25:16.747" style="s2">foolishness that let this vicious woman</p>
<p begin="01:25:15.047" end="01:25:18.747" style="s2">deceive me.</p>
<p begin="01:25:16.747" end="01:25:19.747" style="s2">Lumeria,</p>
<p begin="01:25:18.747" end="01:25:21.947" style="s2">please</p>
<p begin="01:25:19.747" end="01:25:23.347" style="s2">give me one more chance, will you?</p>
<p begin="01:25:21.947" end="01:25:25.247" style="s2">For the sake of all the years we have</p>
<p begin="01:25:23.347" end="01:25:27.147" style="s2">shared.</p>
<p begin="01:25:25.247" end="01:25:29.047" style="s2">Forgive me just this once.</p>
<p begin="01:25:27.147" end="01:25:30.647" style="s2">As long as you come back, I will cast</p>
<p begin="01:25:29.047" end="01:25:32.347" style="s2">her out of the wolf clan at once, and I</p>
<p begin="01:25:30.647" end="01:25:33.547" style="s2">swear I will be good to you alone from</p>
<p begin="01:25:32.347" end="01:25:35.747" style="s2">now on.</p>
<p begin="01:25:33.547" end="01:25:38.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, wipe that lovesick expression</p>
<p begin="01:25:35.747" end="01:25:40.547" style="s2">off your face. You were never deceived.</p>
<p begin="01:25:38.547" end="01:25:42.147" style="s2">You simply chose power over me lucidly</p>
<p begin="01:25:40.547" end="01:25:43.647" style="s2">and greedily. You are doing the exact</p>
<p begin="01:25:42.147" end="01:25:46.647" style="s2">same thing now.</p>
<p begin="01:25:43.647" end="01:25:46.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is my fault.</p>
<p begin="01:25:46.747" end="01:25:50.849" style="s2">But Lumeria, please do not give up on</p>
<p begin="01:25:48.549" end="01:25:50.849" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:25:53.649" end="01:25:59.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO. LUMIRIA, YOU CANNOT BE THIS CRUEL.</p>
<p begin="01:25:56.649" end="01:25:59.549" style="s2">LUMIRIA! [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:26:03.549" end="01:26:06.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ARE YOU ALL RIGHT?</p>
<p begin="01:26:07.448" end="01:26:11.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I AM FINE. IN FACT, I have never felt</p>
<p begin="01:26:09.749" end="01:26:15.448" style="s2">better.</p>
<p begin="01:26:11.749" end="01:26:15.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then congratulations on your rebirth.</p>
<p begin="01:26:19.799" end="01:26:21.819" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:26:21.849" end="01:26:25.694" style="s2">Gone.</p>
<p begin="01:26:23.249" end="01:26:27.714" style="s2">Everything is gone.</p>
<p begin="01:26:25.694" end="01:26:27.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:26:28.349" end="01:26:32.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, you have disappointed us deeply.</p>
<p begin="01:26:30.649" end="01:26:34.448" style="s2">Not only did you fail to win Lumiria</p>
<p begin="01:26:32.448" end="01:26:36.349" style="s2">back, you also thoroughly offended the</p>
<p begin="01:26:34.448" end="01:26:38.549" style="s2">elf king and made a complete mess of his</p>
<p begin="01:26:36.349" end="01:26:41.749" style="s2">banquet, turning the entire wolf clan</p>
<p begin="01:26:38.549" end="01:26:41.749" style="s2">into a laughing stock.</p>
<p begin="01:26:41.849" end="01:26:46.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elder, please give me one more chance. I</p>
<p begin="01:26:43.849" end="01:26:47.948" style="s2">was only deceived by Aria. I will go and</p>
<p begin="01:26:46.149" end="01:26:49.948" style="s2">beg Lumiria again.</p>
<p begin="01:26:47.948" end="01:26:51.948" style="s2">She loves me so much as long as I go and</p>
<p begin="01:26:49.948" end="01:26:54.649" style="s2">admit my fault.</p>
<p begin="01:26:51.948" end="01:26:56.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Look at yourself now. Feral, out</p>
<p begin="01:26:54.649" end="01:26:58.849" style="s2">of control, utterly mindless. Where is</p>
<p begin="01:26:56.948" end="01:27:00.649" style="s2">any trace of the future alpha? Without</p>
<p begin="01:26:58.849" end="01:27:02.549" style="s2">Lumiria, you cannot even hold on to your</p>
<p begin="01:27:00.649" end="01:27:03.849" style="s2">sanity.</p>
<p begin="01:27:02.549" end="01:27:05.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elder, I can endure this.</p>
<p begin="01:27:03.849" end="01:27:07.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On behalf of the Council of Elders, I</p>
<p begin="01:27:05.448" end="01:27:09.249" style="s2">formally declare that Darius is hereby</p>
<p begin="01:27:07.549" end="01:27:10.948" style="s2">stripped of his right of succession in</p>
<p begin="01:27:09.249" end="01:27:12.149" style="s2">the wolf clan. All his resources are</p>
<p begin="01:27:10.948" end="01:27:13.448" style="s2">revoked. He is banished from the</p>
<p begin="01:27:12.149" end="01:27:14.549" style="s2">territory and left to FEND FOR HIMSELF.</p>
<p begin="01:27:13.448" end="01:27:16.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO!</p>
<p begin="01:27:14.549" end="01:27:19.249" style="s2">YOU CANNOT DO THIS TO ME. I AM THE</p>
<p begin="01:27:16.448" end="01:27:19.249" style="s2">FUTURE CHIEFTAIN.</p>
<p begin="01:27:23.448" end="01:27:27.249" style="s2">Raa</p>
<p begin="01:27:25.149" end="01:27:27.249" style="s2">Raa</p>
<p begin="01:27:46.750" end="01:27:50.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumiria for a lying human.</p>
<p begin="01:27:48.850" end="01:27:52.750" style="s2">I bet he is regretting it to his core</p>
<p begin="01:27:50.550" end="01:27:54.850" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="01:27:52.750" end="01:27:57.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:27:54.850" end="01:27:57.750" style="s2">Lumiria&#39;s wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:27:59.550" end="01:28:05.350" style="s2">Lumiria, I am your groom.</p>
<p begin="01:28:01.950" end="01:28:05.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU MUST WAIT [screaming] FOR ME!</p>
<p begin="01:28:09.650" end="01:28:13.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; UGLY THING, STOP STARING INTO SPACE.</p>
<p begin="01:28:12.150" end="01:28:16.750" style="s2">Your face turns my stomach and you are a</p>
<p begin="01:28:13.750" end="01:28:17.950" style="s2">mute besides, but you will do. So,</p>
<p begin="01:28:16.750" end="01:28:19.666" style="s2">shall I come and give you another good</p>
<p begin="01:28:17.950" end="01:28:20.850" style="s2">time?</p>
<p begin="01:28:19.666" end="01:28:23.850" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:28:20.850" end="01:28:27.350" style="s2">What are you glaring at?</p>
<p begin="01:28:23.850" end="01:28:27.350" style="s2">Get over here and serve me well.</p>
<p begin="01:28:28.450" end="01:28:31.850" style="s2">Now you are talking.</p>
<p begin="01:28:30.150" end="01:28:34.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Run, Darius.</p>
<p begin="01:28:31.850" end="01:28:36.650" style="s2">Go find your lofty Lumira. Today, with</p>
<p begin="01:28:34.350" end="01:28:39.950" style="s2">this curse-soaked blade, I will drag you</p>
<p begin="01:28:36.650" end="01:28:39.950" style="s2">all down to hell with me.</p>
<p begin="01:28:42.550" end="01:28:48.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumiria,</p>
<p begin="01:28:43.950" end="01:28:48.450" style="s2">let me in. I am her groom.</p>
<p begin="01:28:50.350" end="01:28:56.250" style="s2">Lumiria,</p>
<p begin="01:28:51.950" end="01:28:56.250" style="s2">you cannot marry him. You are mine.</p>
<p begin="01:28:56.750" end="01:29:00.550" style="s2">I, Calith, hereby vow before heaven and</p>
<p begin="01:28:58.650" end="01:29:02.450" style="s2">earth that my loyalty, my soul, my</p>
<p begin="01:29:00.550" end="01:29:05.350" style="s2">everything shall belong to Lumiria alone</p>
<p begin="01:29:02.450" end="01:29:07.150" style="s2">forever, however the years may turn.</p>
<p begin="01:29:05.350" end="01:29:08.150" style="s2">You are my only choice.</p>
<p begin="01:29:07.150" end="01:29:10.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="01:29:08.150" end="01:29:12.550" style="s2">And I return your loyalty and kind</p>
<p begin="01:29:10.050" end="01:29:12.550" style="s2">forever.</p>
<p begin="01:29:18.650" end="01:29:21.950" style="s2">Did we not already complete the vow</p>
<p begin="01:29:20.150" end="01:29:23.850" style="s2">ceremony beneath the tree of life last</p>
<p begin="01:29:21.950" end="01:29:27.450" style="s2">month? Why go to so much trouble to hold</p>
<p begin="01:29:23.850" end="01:29:27.450" style="s2">another one? Are you not tired?</p>
<p begin="01:29:27.850" end="01:29:31.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could I be tired? I wish I could</p>
<p begin="01:29:29.750" end="01:29:34.150" style="s2">announce to the whole world every single</p>
<p begin="01:29:31.750" end="01:29:36.650" style="s2">day that I belong wholly and utterly to</p>
<p begin="01:29:34.150" end="01:29:36.650" style="s2">Lumiria.</p>
<p begin="01:29:37.650" end="01:29:40.450" style="s2">As long as it lets everyone know you are</p>
<p begin="01:29:39.050" end="01:29:41.350" style="s2">my wife, I would hold it a hundred</p>
<p begin="01:29:40.450" end="01:29:44.050" style="s2">times.</p>
<p begin="01:29:41.350" end="01:29:47.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You, the mighty elf king, can be as</p>
<p begin="01:29:44.050" end="01:29:47.750" style="s2">stubborn as a little child sometimes.</p>
<p begin="01:29:52.951" end="01:29:56.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:29:54.552" end="01:29:59.151" style="s2">That should have been mine.</p>
<p begin="01:29:56.751" end="01:29:59.151" style="s2">Lumira.</p>
<p begin="01:30:02.552" end="01:30:06.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria, please do not go.</p>
<p begin="01:30:05.151" end="01:30:08.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing back here?</p>
<p begin="01:30:06.451" end="01:30:10.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I truly know I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:30:08.451" end="01:30:13.851" style="s2">Only now do I realize how good you have</p>
<p begin="01:30:10.451" end="01:30:13.851" style="s2">been to me all these years.</p>
<p begin="01:30:16.257" end="01:30:18.277" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:30:24.251" end="01:30:27.251" style="s2">And I have finally realized how</p>
<p begin="01:30:25.651" end="01:30:29.951" style="s2">monstrously I treated you all these</p>
<p begin="01:30:27.251" end="01:30:32.951" style="s2">years. It is all my fault, Lumeria.</p>
<p begin="01:30:29.951" end="01:30:35.151" style="s2">Please do not leave me.</p>
<p begin="01:30:32.951" end="01:30:36.151" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take your filthy hands off her. Do not</p>
<p begin="01:30:35.151" end="01:30:38.351" style="s2">touch her.</p>
<p begin="01:30:36.151" end="01:30:39.951" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria, I beg you. As long as you come</p>
<p begin="01:30:38.351" end="01:30:41.851" style="s2">back, I will do whatever you say. I</p>
<p begin="01:30:39.951" end="01:30:43.951" style="s2">should never have believed Aria&#39;s lies.</p>
<p begin="01:30:41.851" end="01:30:45.077" style="s2">I love only you now. Let us start over,</p>
<p begin="01:30:43.951" end="01:30:45.552" style="s2">all right?</p>
<p begin="01:30:45.077" end="01:30:47.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:30:45.552" end="01:30:49.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even now you still try to shift all the</p>
<p begin="01:30:47.351" end="01:30:51.251" style="s2">blame onto someone else. Darius, your</p>
<p begin="01:30:49.351" end="01:30:53.552" style="s2">affection is just as repelling as you</p>
<p begin="01:30:51.251" end="01:30:53.552" style="s2">are.</p>
<p begin="01:30:54.151" end="01:30:57.251" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria,</p>
<p begin="01:30:55.651" end="01:30:59.251" style="s2">let&#39;s never be apart.</p>
<p begin="01:30:57.251" end="01:31:00.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria,</p>
<p begin="01:30:59.251" end="01:31:02.951" style="s2">please</p>
<p begin="01:31:00.751" end="01:31:04.151" style="s2">let us never be apart.</p>
<p begin="01:31:02.951" end="01:31:05.851" style="s2">All right?</p>
<p begin="01:31:04.151" end="01:31:08.151" style="s2">This so-called love of yours is nothing</p>
<p begin="01:31:05.851" end="01:31:08.657" style="s2">but a cornered dog begging FOR SCRAP.</p>
<p begin="01:31:08.151" end="01:31:10.677" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DIE!</p>
<p begin="01:31:08.657" end="01:31:10.677" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:31:14.851" end="01:31:19.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SINCE YOU PROTECT HER SO FIERCELY, then</p>
<p begin="01:31:16.651" end="01:31:19.451" style="s2">die with her.</p>
<p begin="01:31:19.793" end="01:31:22.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:31:20.251" end="01:31:25.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, you you</p>
<p begin="01:31:22.751" end="01:31:25.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria,</p>
<p begin="01:31:26.751" end="01:31:29.552" style="s2">did I frighten you?</p>
<p begin="01:31:28.151" end="01:31:31.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am fine.</p>
<p begin="01:31:29.552" end="01:31:33.451" style="s2">It just feels</p>
<p begin="01:31:31.451" end="01:31:36.552" style="s2">somewhat absurd.</p>
<p begin="01:31:33.451" end="01:31:38.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absurd indeed. A mad dog you lured in</p>
<p begin="01:31:36.552" end="01:31:40.552" style="s2">yourself has ended up tearing out your</p>
<p begin="01:31:38.351" end="01:31:42.552" style="s2">own throat.</p>
<p begin="01:31:40.552" end="01:31:44.651" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why? He would rather die than stop</p>
<p begin="01:31:42.552" end="01:31:46.651" style="s2">protecting me. Lumeria, you have taken</p>
<p begin="01:31:44.651" end="01:31:50.351" style="s2">everything from me. Even if I must go to</p>
<p begin="01:31:46.651" end="01:31:52.451" style="s2">hell, I will drag you down with me.</p>
<p begin="01:31:50.351" end="01:31:54.151" style="s2">Aria, you have lost your mind. You</p>
<p begin="01:31:52.451" end="01:31:55.352" style="s2">schemed so hard to steal this man and</p>
<p begin="01:31:54.151" end="01:31:57.552" style="s2">now you have killed him with your own</p>
<p begin="01:31:55.352" end="01:31:59.452" style="s2">hands and utterly destroyed yourself in</p>
<p begin="01:31:57.552" end="01:32:02.552" style="s2">the process.</p>
<p begin="01:31:59.452" end="01:32:02.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were asking to die.</p>
<p begin="01:32:04.333" end="01:32:06.353" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:32:06.953" end="01:32:08.973" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:32:10.852" end="01:32:14.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At this point, is there anything else</p>
<p begin="01:32:12.352" end="01:32:15.952" style="s2">you wish to say?</p>
<p begin="01:32:14.452" end="01:32:18.252" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:32:15.952" end="01:32:19.452" style="s2">It is all my fault. If not for me, you</p>
<p begin="01:32:18.252" end="01:32:21.352" style="s2">would not have suffered so much</p>
<p begin="01:32:19.452" end="01:32:22.952" style="s2">undeserved misery and Aria would not</p>
<p begin="01:32:21.352" end="01:32:24.638" style="s2">have been reduced to this wretched state</p>
<p begin="01:32:22.952" end="01:32:28.452" style="s2">by my doing.</p>
<p begin="01:32:24.638" end="01:32:28.452" style="s2">[gasps] I have ruined everything.</p>
<p begin="01:32:28.552" end="01:32:31.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That self-pitying, lovesick display of</p>
<p begin="01:32:30.252" end="01:32:33.653" style="s2">yours is truly sickening.</p>
<p begin="01:32:31.752" end="01:32:35.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darius, do you not think it is far too</p>
<p begin="01:32:33.653" end="01:32:37.153" style="s2">late to be saying any of this now? One</p>
<p begin="01:32:35.653" end="01:32:38.752" style="s2">of you greedy and hypocritical, the</p>
<p begin="01:32:37.153" end="01:32:40.452" style="s2">other arrogant and foolish, you have</p>
<p begin="01:32:38.752" end="01:32:41.252" style="s2">both brought this end upon yourself</p>
<p begin="01:32:40.452" end="01:32:43.752" style="s2">entirely.</p>
<p begin="01:32:41.252" end="01:32:45.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know my sins are beyond forgiveness.</p>
<p begin="01:32:43.752" end="01:32:47.852" style="s2">Lumeria, tell me,</p>
<p begin="01:32:45.752" end="01:32:49.852" style="s2">do you even the tiniest bit have even</p>
<p begin="01:32:47.852" end="01:32:51.852" style="s2">the slightest forgiveness for me?</p>
<p begin="01:32:49.852" end="01:32:53.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Even if you were to die here today,</p>
<p begin="01:32:51.852" end="01:32:55.552" style="s2">it would have nothing to do with me</p>
<p begin="01:32:53.153" end="01:32:58.252" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:32:55.552" end="01:32:59.752" style="s2">There is no what if, Darius.</p>
<p begin="01:32:58.252" end="01:33:01.952" style="s2">Even without Aria, there would have been</p>
<p begin="01:32:59.752" end="01:33:04.653" style="s2">someone else.</p>
<p begin="01:33:01.952" end="01:33:07.052" style="s2">It was never her who ruined us.</p>
<p begin="01:33:04.653" end="01:33:09.552" style="s2">It was your selfishness.</p>
<p begin="01:33:07.052" end="01:33:12.452" style="s2">Darius, from beginning to end, all I</p>
<p begin="01:33:09.552" end="01:33:13.852" style="s2">ever wanted was a sincere heart.</p>
<p begin="01:33:12.452" end="01:33:14.852" style="s2">And that is something you could never</p>
<p begin="01:33:13.852" end="01:33:17.752" style="s2">give.</p>
<p begin="01:33:14.852" end="01:33:19.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Lumeria, I do love you. I just</p>
<p begin="01:33:17.752" end="01:33:21.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have already sent word to your mother.</p>
<p begin="01:33:19.752" end="01:33:24.653" style="s2">Between us,</p>
<p begin="01:33:21.352" end="01:33:24.653" style="s2">this is where our debt ends.</p>
<p begin="01:33:28.153" end="01:33:31.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He is not worth another moment of your</p>
<p begin="01:33:29.653" end="01:33:32.352" style="s2">energy. That scene just now did not</p>
<p begin="01:33:31.153" end="01:33:33.752" style="s2">frighten you, did it?</p>
<p begin="01:33:32.352" end="01:33:35.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With you by my side, how could I be</p>
<p begin="01:33:33.752" end="01:33:37.252" style="s2">afraid? And now that the past is truly</p>
<p begin="01:33:35.852" end="01:33:39.252" style="s2">settled,</p>
<p begin="01:33:37.252" end="01:33:40.552" style="s2">I feel nothing but relief.</p>
<p begin="01:33:39.252" end="01:33:42.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is good.</p>
<p begin="01:33:40.552" end="01:33:44.052" style="s2">Come, let us go home.</p>
<p begin="01:33:42.653" end="01:33:45.153" style="s2">Magnus and Aurelia must be getting</p>
<p begin="01:33:44.052" end="01:33:48.452" style="s2">anxious waiting.</p>
<p begin="01:33:45.153" end="01:33:48.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Let us go home.</p>
<p begin="01:33:49.352" end="01:33:51.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lumeria!</p>
<p begin="01:33:50.952" end="01:33:53.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not go.</p>
<p begin="01:33:51.952" end="01:33:55.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I once thought my wedding was the</p>
<p begin="01:33:53.153" end="01:33:57.354" style="s2">darkest day of my life,</p>
<p begin="01:33:55.153" end="01:34:00.054" style="s2">but now my true partner has it into a</p>
<p begin="01:33:57.354" end="01:34:00.054" style="s2">happy memory.</p>
<p begin="01:34:01.579" end="01:34:03.599" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:34:05.254" end="01:34:11.954" style="s2">And now it is time for me to go home</p>
<p begin="01:34:07.454" end="01:34:11.954" style="s2">with my true partner and my family.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
